WEBVTT

00:34.620 --> 00:36.150
<b>It's good to see you again.</b>

00:36.150 --> 00:37.570
<b>It's me, Togashi Kuzuha.</b>

00:36.390 --> 00:36.890
<b></b>My Brother 2

00:36.390 --> 00:36.890
<b></b>My Brother 2

00:36.890 --> 00:40.310
<b></b>My Brother 2

00:38.020 --> 00:43.250
<b>This is a story from when my brother was 
in eighth grade and still acted weird.</b>

00:43.690 --> 00:44.870
A star.

00:45.640 --> 00:46.750
That's right!

00:47.620 --> 00:50.450
It appears I have grown accustomed to this body.

00:50.450 --> 00:52.530
You've been getting them all right tonight!

00:52.530 --> 00:56.790
For one of my prowess, this works not a shred of my powers.

00:57.300 --> 00:58.160
Then...

01:04.060 --> 01:04.880
What's this?

01:04.880 --> 01:07.110
Hmph. Simple.

01:18.520 --> 01:20.630
Let us end our little game here for tonight.

01:20.630 --> 01:25.890
Excessive use of my powers may alter the flow of mana through our world.

01:26.650 --> 01:27.850
Yuuta!

01:27.850 --> 01:29.610
Did you stick this on our door?

01:30.740 --> 01:32.970
Fool! How dare you remove it from its fixture?

01:32.970 --> 01:35.690
How dare you call your mother a fool?!

01:35.690 --> 01:38.310
You know, Onii-chan put one on our balcony too.

01:38.310 --> 01:39.190
What?!

01:43.540 --> 01:44.350
It has come.

01:44.350 --> 01:45.170
It has come!

01:45.980 --> 01:49.150
I can feel the powers of darkness filling my body!

01:49.150 --> 01:51.630
The powers of the Dark Lord Beelzecifer!

01:51.630 --> 01:54.210
Onii-chan, what are you doing?

01:54.210 --> 01:55.580
Stand back!

01:55.580 --> 01:58.550
Come too close, and you shall be reduced to ash!

01:58.550 --> 01:59.190
Huh?

01:59.940 --> 02:04.670
This glorious night, as the myriad invisible starshades shower the land,

02:04.670 --> 02:08.230
the powers of the Dark Lord Beelzecifer shall fill this body.

02:09.060 --> 02:10.110
At this moment...

02:10.110 --> 02:11.780
I am dangerous!

02:15.580 --> 02:18.230
Be still! Be still, my arm!

02:27.020 --> 02:28.130
Ow...

02:28.130 --> 02:30.940
Onii-chan, are you okay?!

02:30.940 --> 02:31.730
It hurts...

02:32.340 --> 02:33.670
Ow, ow, ow...

02:34.560 --> 02:35.470
Ow...

02:43.020 --> 02:46.770
I never dreamed I'd return to this place.

02:47.270 --> 02:49.250
I'll go get some stuff for dinner.

02:49.250 --> 02:50.710
Can you get home by yourself?

02:50.710 --> 02:53.110
I have urgent matters to attend to.

02:53.110 --> 02:54.670
Go. Do not mind me.

02:54.670 --> 02:57.160
Kuzuha, take care of your brother, okay?

02:57.160 --> 02:57.930
Okay.

02:58.900 --> 02:59.890
This smell...

02:59.890 --> 03:03.110
It seems they will not give me peace.

03:03.980 --> 03:06.170
Kuzuha, take my back.

03:07.120 --> 03:08.670
Simply standing will do.

03:10.220 --> 03:13.450
My body, infused with more dark mana than ever before,

03:13.450 --> 03:15.390
will not break so easily.

03:17.520 --> 03:19.030
No one's there.

03:19.030 --> 03:20.510
No, there is.

03:21.220 --> 03:22.220
There!

03:22.920 --> 03:25.850
Onii-chan! The doctor said not to run around!

03:27.340 --> 03:28.860
This body is but temporary.

03:29.340 --> 03:32.860
I freed myself of all pain in eternities long past.

03:33.870 --> 03:37.610
Unfortunately, such is the fate of one who lives in darkness.

03:38.140 --> 03:39.370
Sister.

03:39.370 --> 03:40.390
What?

03:40.920 --> 03:43.030
This body has not long.

03:43.030 --> 03:45.550
But you just said it wouldn't break...

03:46.080 --> 03:47.510
I wish you happiness.

03:52.500 --> 03:53.730
Kuzuha-chan!

03:53.730 --> 03:55.270
Oh, Mika-chan?

03:55.270 --> 03:57.300
Did your brother get hurt?

03:57.300 --> 04:00.450
Yeah, he fractured his leg.

04:00.450 --> 04:02.060
Oh, really?

04:02.780 --> 04:03.850
He's so cool!

04:03.850 --> 04:04.730
What?!

04:06.860 --> 04:12.610
For a moment, I thought that maybe, just maybe, Onii-chan might actually be cool.

