06:33.340 --> 06:35.720
Damn, I'm nervous...

06:36.510 --> 06:37.320
Come in!

06:38.290 --> 06:40.800
Wow, sharp as heck, dude!

06:40.800 --> 06:44.460
Isshiki? What're you doing here?

06:44.460 --> 06:47.020
It's my best friend's wedding!

06:47.020 --> 06:48.180
Why <i>wouldn't</i> I be here?

06:48.560 --> 06:50.480
I don't remember inviting you.

06:50.480 --> 06:51.280
Remember to, damn it!

06:51.280 --> 06:54.260
I didn't even get a freaking invitation!

06:54.260 --> 06:58.190
Oh, okay. That means you <i>weren't</i> invited.

06:58.190 --> 06:59.860
Quit being so mean!

06:59.860 --> 07:03.360
Anyway, I'm surprised you've come this far.

07:03.360 --> 07:07.400
I mean, you're marrying the
fourth cutest girl in the class!

07:07.870 --> 07:10.020
I'd better kick myself into high gear too!

07:10.020 --> 07:12.700
How's it going with Kumin-senpai?

07:12.700 --> 07:13.940
Perfectly!

07:14.720 --> 07:15.250
Come in!

07:15.250 --> 07:17.210
Togashi-kun, it's almost time.

07:17.770 --> 07:19.920
Kumin-senpai! Long time no see!

07:20.630 --> 07:23.480
Um... Hello. Pleased to meet you.

07:23.480 --> 07:27.930
My name is Tsuyuri Kumin. I was
in the same club as Togashi-kun.

07:27.930 --> 07:29.940
Kumin-senpai...

07:29.940 --> 07:31.970
It's me! Isshiki Makoto!

07:32.530 --> 07:33.860
Isshiki-san?

07:33.860 --> 07:36.770
How did you meet Togashi-kun?

07:38.390 --> 07:38.900
Here!

07:39.580 --> 07:41.270
That was a wig?!

07:41.270 --> 07:43.500
Oh, a monk?

07:43.500 --> 07:46.740
Was this supposed to be a Buddhist wedding?

07:46.740 --> 07:49.220
Kumin-senpai...

07:49.220 --> 07:51.400
Man, just give up already.

07:52.610 --> 07:54.280
Two years have passed since then.

07:55.510 --> 07:59.100
I didn't think that we would end up like this, though.

08:04.880 --> 08:06.040
Rikka!

08:06.040 --> 08:07.540
Are you okay?

08:08.180 --> 08:09.390
Today, Rikka and I...

08:11.090 --> 08:12.760
are getting married.

08:16.830 --> 08:18.300
There we go. Be careful now.

08:19.230 --> 08:20.120
Thanks.

08:20.120 --> 08:21.560
Don't mention it.

08:21.560 --> 08:25.520
I hope that idiot doesn't seriously plan on missing this.

08:25.520 --> 08:26.940
She's not here yet?

08:26.940 --> 08:28.910
Yeah, I just checked the pews.

08:29.410 --> 08:33.630
Dekomori and I have shared our
fate as master and servant until now.

08:33.630 --> 08:36.360
This is indeed a difficult contract for her to accept.

08:37.350 --> 08:38.790
It is almost time for the ceremony.

08:39.170 --> 08:40.560
We wish you the best.

08:41.130 --> 08:41.940
See you inside.

08:46.570 --> 08:47.520
Yuuta...

08:47.520 --> 08:48.170
What is it?

08:48.730 --> 08:50.000
I'm scared.

08:50.680 --> 08:52.040
Don't worry.

08:53.710 --> 08:54.560
I am too.

08:55.010 --> 08:56.430
Yuuta!

09:05.940 --> 09:07.990
Rikka's so pretty!

09:12.550 --> 09:14.620
I'm happy... I'm so happy!

09:14.620 --> 09:17.200
Here, Mori Summer-chan, use my handkerchief.

09:17.200 --> 09:19.160
Don't call me that!

09:20.810 --> 09:22.920
You may now kiss the bride.

09:27.730 --> 09:28.970
Rikka.

09:43.020 --> 09:45.500
A-A dark beast approaches!

09:45.500 --> 09:46.510
Huh?

09:46.510 --> 09:48.030
Cut it out!

09:49.730 --> 09:51.450
Yuuta! That hurt!

09:51.450 --> 09:53.800
Where do you think we are?!

09:53.800 --> 09:55.100
We're in a church!

09:55.100 --> 09:56.320
It's our wedding ceremony!

09:56.320 --> 09:58.260
What of it?!

09:58.260 --> 10:00.740
Be it contained by a barrier of light,

10:00.740 --> 10:06.220
the Tyrant's Eye may still summon
the powers of darkness to itself!

10:06.220 --> 10:07.170
What are you talking about?!

10:07.170 --> 10:13.920
Furthermore, our contract was formed the
moment your eye met with the Tyrant's Eye.

10:13.920 --> 10:18.810
What meaning is there in performing a
ceremony corrupted by this lower world?!

10:19.150 --> 10:20.500
So you wanna call it off?

10:21.810 --> 10:22.440
No.

10:22.440 --> 10:25.060
Pick one, damn it!

10:25.060 --> 10:29.120
Pick one!

10:25.060 --> 10:26.520
That hurts!

10:26.520 --> 10:29.120
Yuuta! That hurts!

10:29.120 --> 10:31.620
Enough of this farce!

10:32.280 --> 10:33.140
Who?

10:33.140 --> 10:34.030
This voice...

10:34.530 --> 10:35.570
That idiot.

10:35.570 --> 10:42.940
I, your faithful servant Dekomori Sanae,
shall never accept this ceremony or your new contract!

10:42.940 --> 10:44.120
Up there!

10:47.010 --> 10:50.640
You are my master, and mine alone!

11:03.100 --> 11:06.100
Now, Master, come with me.

11:07.290 --> 11:09.320
No, Dekomori.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.480
Master!

11:11.610 --> 11:12.720
I'm sorry.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.360
Then...

11:19.150 --> 11:21.540
Then may all return to dust!

11:26.790 --> 11:27.900
Yuuta!

11:38.270 --> 11:39.580
This barrier...

11:39.580 --> 11:41.760
You have gained a new power?

11:41.760 --> 11:50.320
Schwarzsechs Prototype Mark IV's Miasmic Causality
Disruptor Shield nullifies any and all offensive magic.

11:50.970 --> 11:53.280
All of you should use this opportunity to escape.

11:53.280 --> 11:55.040
Be careful, Rikka Onee-chan.

11:55.040 --> 11:56.220
Let's go, Yumeha!

11:56.220 --> 11:57.410
Rikka, you're so cool!

12:01.410 --> 12:05.200
Faerie of the wind, join with me and become one!

12:27.130 --> 12:31.640
His hook he baited with a dragon's tail.

13:00.090 --> 13:02.720
This is for trying to take Master from me!

13:02.720 --> 13:05.760
What rent my heart will rend your body!

13:06.970 --> 13:08.100
Mori Summer-chan!

13:08.790 --> 13:10.310
Kumin-senpai!

13:12.060 --> 13:14.100
Isshiki!

13:14.100 --> 13:14.980
Kumin!

13:15.350 --> 13:16.320
Don't worry!

13:16.320 --> 13:18.480
I've awakened my powers as well!

13:19.210 --> 13:22.120
The time is now 9:03! Kumin!

13:22.820 --> 13:24.340
The time has come!

13:24.340 --> 13:26.140
Awaken, Hypnos!

13:28.930 --> 13:31.290
Fall into eternal slumber!

13:31.640 --> 13:35.040
Explosive Sleeping!

13:39.300 --> 13:41.630
How does <i>you</i> sleeping help us?!

13:39.300 --> 13:41.630
How does <i>you</i> sleeping help us?!

13:41.630 --> 13:46.760
Wedding cake is the most dangerous food in the world...

13:46.760 --> 13:47.940
Yuuta!

13:48.630 --> 13:49.700
So be it!

13:54.950 --> 13:59.550
I am the Fighting Darkness, come
from the furthest reaches of shadow.

13:59.550 --> 14:03.540
The Dark Flame Master, blazing in dark glory!

14:05.660 --> 14:08.040
Y-You...

14:08.040 --> 14:11.660
You should not have challenged me with a dragon,

14:11.660 --> 14:15.570
Dekomori Sanae—no, the Mjollnir Hammer!

14:15.570 --> 14:18.050
Wh-What do you mean?

14:19.530 --> 14:22.900
Have you forgotten what slumbers within me?

14:24.050 --> 14:25.800
The Black Flame Dragon?!

14:25.800 --> 14:26.940
No!

14:26.940 --> 14:30.020
The dragon which resides within
me has surpassed such a title!

14:30.020 --> 14:32.810
It has evolved into the Dark Flame Dragon!

14:34.710 --> 14:38.270
Of those endowed with dark
powers in the last four millenia,

14:38.270 --> 14:43.140
only six were able to contain it
within them: the Dark Flame Dragon!

14:49.790 --> 14:52.160
And it resides within you now?

14:59.460 --> 15:01.550
Deko!

15:03.350 --> 15:08.300
Then all that remains for me is
to unleash my ultimate technique.

15:09.090 --> 15:10.760
Here I go!

15:12.150 --> 15:15.440
Apocalypse Hammer!

15:16.400 --> 15:18.310
Yuuta! Now!

15:18.310 --> 15:19.820
Rikka!

15:23.440 --> 15:25.580
Bridal Attack!

15:25.580 --> 15:26.860
For better or for worse!

15:26.860 --> 15:28.660
In sickness and in health!

15:28.660 --> 15:31.260
In joy and in sorrow!

15:31.260 --> 15:35.040
To love and to cherish from this day forward!

15:35.040 --> 15:36.980
Until death do us part!

15:49.680 --> 15:52.890
I don't want this kind of wedding gift!

16:00.980 --> 16:01.980
Rikka!

16:01.980 --> 16:02.960
Yuuta!

16:04.010 --> 16:05.400
Yuuta!

16:38.790 --> 16:41.100
What a vulgar dream.

16:41.570 --> 16:45.690
Rafflesia goes best with Worchestershire...

16:48.690 --> 16:50.320
Oh, Master!

16:52.970 --> 16:56.060
How went the battle in the parallel world?

16:59.290 --> 17:01.300
It was ferocious.

17:01.880 --> 17:03.420
I see!

17:03.420 --> 17:06.090
I wish I could have joined you!

17:09.010 --> 17:10.400
Where's Yuuta?

17:10.400 --> 17:11.960
Yet to return, it seems.

17:15.350 --> 17:17.000
Do not worry.

17:17.000 --> 17:20.980
The Dark Flame Master said to believe in him.

17:20.980 --> 17:22.560
So believe.

17:23.250 --> 17:28.190
Believe in the Dark Flame Master
who Master believes in, Master.

17:28.190 --> 17:31.820
I don't quite understand, but okay.

17:31.820 --> 17:36.450
He will secure victory in this final battle and return.

17:43.730 --> 17:50.700
I would much rather hear all that happened
between you and the Dark Flame Master.

17:52.090 --> 17:57.440
How the two of you, who met in
aeons past, arrived at this juncture.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.940
Dekomori...

17:58.940 --> 18:01.500
I want to hear too.

18:05.650 --> 18:07.700
Very well. I will tell you.

18:08.590 --> 18:13.000
The history of the Tyrant's Eye and the Dark
Flame Master, from their first encounter

18:13.690 --> 18:17.180
to how they arrived at this juncture.

