20:15.570 --> 20:17.320
The shame! The shame! The shame!

20:17.320 --> 20:19.450
Go away! Go away! Go away!

20:20.090 --> 20:24.330
When the Tyrant's Eye first
encountered the Dark Flame Master,

20:24.330 --> 20:27.000
the Dark Flame Master was struggling in agony,

20:27.000 --> 20:31.140
caught between his present,
constructed memories and his past.

20:32.330 --> 20:35.590
I offered him a helping hand.

20:35.970 --> 20:37.440
That was how it all began.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.220
Ow...

20:53.190 --> 20:54.440
Did you see?

20:56.310 --> 20:57.360
No!

20:57.360 --> 20:59.070
Do you want to see?

20:59.070 --> 21:00.280
Huh?

21:13.840 --> 21:14.960
It opened?!

21:18.550 --> 21:20.510
I am the Dark Flame Master!

21:21.090 --> 21:23.550
Be engulfed by the Dark Flame and die!

21:26.930 --> 21:28.770
Sealed for all eternity!

21:31.930 --> 21:34.240
So we finally meet.

21:36.570 --> 21:37.580
My eye!

21:37.580 --> 21:39.320
My eye! It resonates!

21:39.320 --> 21:40.840
Do you know her?

21:40.840 --> 21:42.110
No, I don't!

21:42.110 --> 21:46.450
For aeons have I searched
this sphere, solely to meet you.

21:48.950 --> 21:49.880
My eye!

21:49.880 --> 21:51.670
My eye!

21:52.280 --> 21:53.920
My eye...

21:54.370 --> 21:58.060
The nurse had to step out for a bit,
so they said to put some eyedrops in for now.

22:00.370 --> 22:02.880
If we don't hurry, we'll miss the ceremony.

22:04.050 --> 22:05.800
You were on my balcony last night, weren't you?

22:06.930 --> 22:08.270
What was that all about?

22:08.270 --> 22:10.450
It resonated.

22:10.450 --> 22:11.520
My eye.

22:12.350 --> 22:16.580
Yes. We have met before, in ages long past.

22:16.580 --> 22:21.360
The Tyrant's Eye of Truth revealed this
to me the moment you entered its sight.

22:21.360 --> 22:24.180
I awaited my opportunity to make contact with you.

22:27.310 --> 22:28.660
This bitterness!

22:28.660 --> 22:30.120
The agents of the darkness!

22:30.470 --> 22:32.460
And so, it is sealed.

22:33.770 --> 22:38.460
The Tyrant's Eye of Truth is realized by controlling
the powers of the darkness with a pure heart.

22:38.460 --> 22:41.680
As such, contact with both the corruption of darkness

22:41.680 --> 22:45.220
and the purity of holy water must be avoided.

22:45.220 --> 22:47.940
I nearly fell into a trap set by my enemies.

22:48.590 --> 22:50.100
Do not let your guard down,

22:50.100 --> 22:52.100
Dark Flame Master.

22:54.270 --> 22:55.980
Be engulfed by the Dark Flame and—

22:55.980 --> 22:57.440
Stop!

22:57.440 --> 22:58.860
How do you know about that?!

22:58.860 --> 22:59.690
Where did you hear that?!

22:59.690 --> 23:03.760
The Tyrant's Eye sees all truth.

23:03.760 --> 23:06.950
All things about you, Yuuta, level 7 mage.

23:06.950 --> 23:07.940
Where on Earth did you hear that?!

23:07.940 --> 23:10.830
With but a glimpse, your past and future—

23:10.830 --> 23:12.240
Where did you hear that?!

23:14.530 --> 23:15.480
Yuuta!

23:15.480 --> 23:16.210
That hurts!

23:16.210 --> 23:19.080
I asked, where did you hear that?!

23:17.570 --> 23:18.900
I can't see!

23:18.900 --> 23:21.550
Yuuta, I can't see!

23:21.550 --> 23:24.580
I heard you say it behind the gym!

23:25.210 --> 23:26.050
The gym?!

23:27.190 --> 23:29.300
I didn't think anyone could hear...

23:29.300 --> 23:33.000
Listen, you'd better not tell anyone about it!

23:33.000 --> 23:34.200
I know.

23:34.200 --> 23:36.860
I know the laws that govern
distortions on the Unseen Horizon

23:36.860 --> 23:38.440
and the structural changes that such phenomena—

23:38.440 --> 23:39.150
No!

23:39.590 --> 23:41.260
I'm talking about my past!

23:41.260 --> 23:44.650
About me being the Dark Flame
Master and wielding the Dark Flame!

23:44.650 --> 23:46.500
Why? It's so cool.

23:46.500 --> 23:47.870
It's <i>not</i> cool!

23:47.870 --> 23:52.020
Look, I graduated that along with middle school!

23:52.020 --> 23:53.750
Completely done! Never going back!

23:55.390 --> 23:56.580
Really?

23:56.580 --> 23:57.810
Yeah.

23:57.810 --> 24:00.180
You've finally advanced to level 8 magehood?!

24:00.180 --> 24:02.740
No!

24:02.740 --> 24:04.240
Eighth-grade syndrome!

24:04.240 --> 24:07.040
I'm not the Dark Flame Master or a mage!

24:07.040 --> 24:08.720
I'm a normal kid starting high school!

24:09.720 --> 24:12.550
Don't give me that look.

24:12.550 --> 24:16.060
Just so you know, you're a
normal kid starting high school too.

24:16.060 --> 24:18.200
I have the Tyrant's Eye.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.860
Doesn't matter.

24:19.860 --> 24:22.980
And whatever it is, it doesn't exist in the first place.

24:22.980 --> 24:24.360
It exists.

24:24.360 --> 24:25.860
No, it doesn't.

24:26.290 --> 24:28.360
Do you want to see it, then?

24:28.360 --> 24:29.360
Huh?

24:31.190 --> 24:34.370
My eye. Do you want to see it?

24:38.390 --> 24:40.120
Yeah. Show me.

24:48.530 --> 24:49.890
No way...

24:53.750 --> 24:56.420
No freaking way!

25:04.230 --> 25:06.740
Hold on a second. I'll put it in again.

25:06.740 --> 25:08.610
A color contact?!

25:10.610 --> 25:12.380
When'd you move in?

25:12.380 --> 25:15.840
I thought there was an office lady living alone above us.

25:15.840 --> 25:17.860
My transmigration occurred two days ago.

25:17.860 --> 25:20.120
Takanashi Touka is my elder sister.

25:20.120 --> 25:21.320
I see.

25:21.320 --> 25:22.750
So you moved in with your sister.

25:22.750 --> 25:25.120
So it would appear.

25:25.120 --> 25:29.520
But Touka is actually a mage with the
Unseen Horizon Administration Bureau.

25:29.520 --> 25:30.360
An enemy.

25:30.360 --> 25:31.390
Hey...

25:31.390 --> 25:33.920
Once she awakens, there is no fighting her,

25:33.920 --> 25:36.140
even with the Tyrant's Eye.

25:36.140 --> 25:37.400
She's terrifying!

25:37.400 --> 25:38.930
She's <i>that</i> scary?

25:38.930 --> 25:41.400
Don't give up, Rikka! Stand your ground!

25:41.880 --> 25:44.260
I can see why your sister'd be angry.

25:44.260 --> 25:46.020
You keep spewing weird stuff like that.

25:46.020 --> 25:48.240
I request your assistance, Yuuta.

25:48.240 --> 25:50.540
With the power of the Dark Flame Master,

25:50.540 --> 25:54.880
we can break through the Administration Bureau's
interference and find the Unseen Horizon!

25:54.880 --> 25:56.960
I told you not to call me that!

25:59.160 --> 26:01.500
I thought up a new attack for you.

26:04.410 --> 26:07.250
Judgment Lucifer!

26:09.590 --> 26:10.670
Well?

26:10.670 --> 26:13.500
You're wearing roller shoes?

26:13.500 --> 26:14.520
What are you, a kid?

26:14.520 --> 26:16.310
They provide superior mobility.

26:16.310 --> 26:20.060
And with these, if I'm hit by an enemy attack...

26:26.330 --> 26:28.780
"Looks like they broke two or three ribs."

26:28.780 --> 26:30.690
I can do this! It's cool!

26:30.690 --> 26:32.880
Don't do that in public!

26:34.620 --> 26:35.640
What do you want?

26:35.640 --> 26:36.660
I'll treat you.

26:38.370 --> 26:39.360
Wait.

26:43.350 --> 26:47.560
Up, up, down, down, left, right, left, right...

26:43.920 --> 26:47.640
Hey, Takanashi-san... the train...

26:47.560 --> 26:49.480
Now put the coin in!

26:49.480 --> 26:49.840
Huh?

26:51.380 --> 26:53.220
And now, B and A!

26:53.220 --> 26:54.590
"B and A"?! What?!

26:58.350 --> 27:00.920
A drink to restore magic power.

27:00.920 --> 27:04.060
The Administration Bureau has
secretly stored them in various places.

27:04.060 --> 27:07.020
