27:11.670 --> 27:13.960
Now do you see my power?

27:13.960 --> 27:16.620
No, you looked surprised, yourself.

27:18.200 --> 27:20.680
Onii-chan, who's this?

27:20.680 --> 27:22.940
You know Takanashi-san
upstairs? It's her younger sister.

27:22.940 --> 27:24.680
She moved in with her.

27:24.680 --> 27:26.500
Oh...

27:26.500 --> 27:28.740
How much stuff do you have?

27:28.740 --> 27:31.340
Isn't this a bit much for one person?

27:31.710 --> 27:33.470
They're all very important.

27:33.470 --> 27:36.180
I really hope they're not <i>all</i> junk!

27:36.180 --> 27:38.050
Some of it is useful.

27:38.910 --> 27:40.640
Oh, it's an automatic.

27:40.640 --> 27:41.700
It can serve as a weapon.

27:41.700 --> 27:43.260
Gungnir! Ha!

27:43.680 --> 27:46.060
And for defense...

27:46.060 --> 27:47.520
Schwarzschild!

27:48.150 --> 27:49.220
Schwarzschild!

27:49.220 --> 27:50.940
Enough! I get it!

27:51.730 --> 27:52.820
Here.

27:53.310 --> 27:54.860
Just get them out of here.

28:04.290 --> 28:06.160
Fine, I'll help.

28:16.250 --> 28:18.060
And that's the last one.

28:18.060 --> 28:19.120
Thank you.

28:19.120 --> 28:20.120
I'm grateful.

28:21.530 --> 28:23.180
Yeah, you'd better be.

28:26.130 --> 28:27.440
Where's your sister?

28:27.440 --> 28:29.320
It seems she always comes home late.

28:32.630 --> 28:35.070
Oh, Takanashi-san's sister?

28:35.070 --> 28:37.820
You're both so pretty!

28:37.820 --> 28:39.880
Yuuta, you need to work hard!

28:39.880 --> 28:41.070
At what?

28:41.070 --> 28:43.410
Um... Your eye...

28:43.410 --> 28:44.760
Just ignore it.

28:44.760 --> 28:46.910
There's nothing wrong with it at all.

28:46.910 --> 28:51.640
The Tyrant's Eye of Truth is realized
by controlling the powers of darkness—

28:52.340 --> 28:54.180
And you don't need to explain.

28:54.180 --> 28:55.590
Understood.

28:55.590 --> 28:57.010
Begone!

28:59.330 --> 29:01.620
Yumeha, don't just bring that thing in here!

29:01.620 --> 29:02.050
Ow!

29:02.450 --> 29:03.560
It's cool!

29:03.560 --> 29:05.020
It's <i>not</i> cool!

29:05.020 --> 29:06.560
It's cool!

29:06.560 --> 29:09.400
If you equipped that on your back, it would be perfect!

29:09.400 --> 29:10.600
Perfect?

29:10.600 --> 29:12.720
Onii-chan used to do that.

29:12.720 --> 29:14.940
He wore this weird black coat
and strapped that on his back.

29:14.940 --> 29:15.860
Kuzuha!

29:15.860 --> 29:19.300
Yuuta acted so funny back then.

29:19.300 --> 29:22.450
He'd chant weird spells or
something before he ate and stuff.

29:22.450 --> 29:23.780
Mom!

29:23.780 --> 29:25.660
Don't you have to go to work tonight?

29:26.810 --> 29:28.000
Fine...

29:30.110 --> 29:31.540
Honestly...

29:32.500 --> 29:35.820
I told them not to play with it because it was trash.

29:35.820 --> 29:36.640
Trash?

29:38.750 --> 29:39.520
Yeah.

29:39.520 --> 29:42.060
Even though it means everything
to the Dark Flame Master?

29:42.060 --> 29:45.600
I keep telling you, I'm done with all that stuff.

29:45.600 --> 29:46.850
Why?

29:47.290 --> 29:48.810
Because it's embarrassing.

29:48.810 --> 29:50.550
It's cool.

29:50.550 --> 29:51.860
It's <i>not</i> cool.

29:52.510 --> 29:53.770
Not in the least.

29:56.250 --> 30:00.350
There's no point in acting like that in the first place.

30:00.350 --> 30:04.020
The Dark Flame and the power of the
Black Flame Dragon don't even exist.

30:05.150 --> 30:07.320
I was just being stupid.

30:08.280 --> 30:09.260
They exist.

30:09.260 --> 30:10.540
They have power.

30:10.950 --> 30:12.060
They don't.

30:12.060 --> 30:13.020
They do.

30:14.780 --> 30:16.020
Look...

30:16.460 --> 30:17.400
They do.

30:18.330 --> 30:19.240
So...

30:20.220 --> 30:22.780
So don't throw them away.

30:36.070 --> 30:38.360
Be engulfed by the Dark Flame and begone!

30:48.430 --> 30:49.540
Don't get me wrong.

30:50.150 --> 30:53.200
I just thought it'd be a waste to throw them all away.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.790
I'll sell them and get some money back.

31:01.530 --> 31:05.100
My apartment is on the second floor,
and Takanashi-san's is right above.

31:07.590 --> 31:09.310
Magic code: unlocked.

31:10.470 --> 31:12.560
Stop being dramatic and open the door.

31:12.560 --> 31:13.690
Shh!

31:16.350 --> 31:17.360
It's open.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.700
It's finally open!

31:18.700 --> 31:20.230
You're giving me a headache.

31:20.570 --> 31:21.740
Wait here.

31:22.450 --> 31:25.440
I must ensure no distortions are present in my room.

31:26.790 --> 31:29.760
Sorry we invited ourselves over just like that, I guess.

31:29.760 --> 31:31.240
Every girl has her secrets.

31:33.750 --> 31:36.500
Welcome to the Dark Side.

31:36.500 --> 31:39.130
Welcome to the Pandemonic Chaos.

31:39.130 --> 31:41.440
I hope you know that's redundant.

31:42.790 --> 31:46.300
You have a lot of cute stuffed animals.

31:46.300 --> 31:48.260
That's Genbu, Guardian of the North.

31:49.870 --> 31:51.940
It's a Mauser C96!

31:51.940 --> 31:54.140
You've got some good taste!

31:54.610 --> 31:57.480
It's a holy gun with the power to vanquish evil.

31:57.480 --> 32:00.020
Yeah, that's definitely the vibe it gives.

32:00.020 --> 32:01.520
Can I touch it?

32:01.520 --> 32:02.200
Yes.

32:03.690 --> 32:06.340
Man, Mausers are so cool!

32:06.340 --> 32:07.580
Ba-ba-ba-bang!

32:07.580 --> 32:08.660
Ba-bang!

32:11.110 --> 32:16.040
Um... The original model for this gun was
made over 100 years ago, and it's really famous!

32:16.040 --> 32:19.540
This is the M712 variant, and...

32:19.540 --> 32:22.420
Togashi-kun, you like those kinds of things?

32:25.170 --> 32:26.400
Whose cat is it?

32:29.800 --> 32:32.060
Closing airlock!

32:32.060 --> 32:34.220
Flooding anti-radiation shield!

32:34.670 --> 32:35.920
Everyone out!

32:35.920 --> 32:36.730
What?!

32:41.610 --> 32:45.760
Togashi-kun, let's run to the ends of the Earth together!

32:45.760 --> 32:47.110
I might just take you up on that.

32:47.110 --> 32:49.860
This is the end of the Earth!

32:49.860 --> 32:52.660
Because the world is round!

32:52.660 --> 32:54.020
We need to get out of here.

32:54.020 --> 32:56.540
She's the Administration Bureau's strongest priestess!

32:58.390 --> 33:00.200
This is so much fun!

33:00.200 --> 33:01.800
It's like a horror movie!

33:01.800 --> 33:03.040
This isn't fun.

33:04.810 --> 33:06.260
I just saw a flash!

33:08.570 --> 33:09.470
Tsuyuri-san!

33:14.720 --> 33:19.100
Come forth, Schwarzsechs Prototype Mark II!

33:20.010 --> 33:21.100
Reality, be rent!

33:21.100 --> 33:22.730
Synapse, break!

33:22.730 --> 33:26.530
Vanishment, this world!

33:32.910 --> 33:36.910
By the blood contract, I summon thee unto this world.

33:42.600 --> 33:44.720
Königin der Nacht.

33:59.790 --> 34:03.150
Dark Matter Blaze!

34:17.550 --> 34:18.540
Takanashi!

34:18.540 --> 34:20.680
Nergal Blast!

34:23.960 --> 34:25.880
Gun Twinkle!

34:38.190 --> 34:40.810
Cut it out!

34:47.570 --> 34:53.030
She said that she wanted to try getting
thrown into the air like a cheerleader.

34:53.030 --> 34:54.780
Are you sure about this?

34:55.200 --> 34:58.140
In the war for the Unseen Horizon,

34:58.140 --> 35:03.780
I flew at altitudes of thousands
of meters without a problem.

35:03.780 --> 35:05.520
What is she talking about?

35:05.520 --> 35:06.380
Dunno.

35:06.990 --> 35:08.210
So, can you do it?

35:09.340 --> 35:10.900
Want to come down?

35:10.900 --> 35:12.880
I-I'm fine!

35:19.670 --> 35:20.390
I'm fine!

35:24.730 --> 35:25.900
Sorry it's so sudden.

35:25.900 --> 35:27.280
What's up?

35:27.280 --> 35:28.900
What did you want to talk about?

35:28.900 --> 35:31.400
This is really embarrassing for me, so I'll only say it once.

35:32.370 --> 35:36.060
You know, Togashi-kun, I...

35:38.610 --> 35:39.520
L!

35:39.520 --> 35:40.420
O!

35:40.420 --> 35:41.360
V!

35:41.360 --> 35:42.250
E!

35:42.250 --> 35:43.750
Love!

35:45.540 --> 35:46.740
That tickles!

35:46.740 --> 35:48.760
That tickles!

35:48.760 --> 35:49.680
I heard you.

35:49.680 --> 35:51.250
I heard y—

35:52.790 --> 35:55.320
It seems you've finally returned,

35:55.320 --> 35:57.260
Dark Flame Master.

35:58.350 --> 35:59.760
Who the heck are you?!

36:00.630 --> 36:04.560
You should introduce yourself before
asking the same of someone else.

36:05.060 --> 36:06.680
I was kidding!

36:06.680 --> 36:08.400
I'll introduce myself! I'll introduce myself!

36:08.400 --> 36:09.300
So who are you?

36:09.300 --> 36:12.030
Please untie my hair first!

36:12.030 --> 36:16.530
First servant to the Wielder of the
Tyrant's Eye, Takanashi Rikka,

36:16.530 --> 36:20.200
Wielder of the Mjollnir Hammer, Dekomori Sanae!

36:20.200 --> 36:21.990
Ready for battle!

36:23.350 --> 36:24.290
Go home.

36:24.290 --> 36:27.840
I, Dekomori, shall purify your heart!

36:27.840 --> 36:32.900
Mjollnir Tornado!

36:37.670 --> 36:39.260
I can't move.

36:39.260 --> 36:40.260
She's an idiot...

36:40.260 --> 36:42.760
An honest-to-God idiot.

36:43.210 --> 36:48.200
Dekomori will join my Far East Magical Napping Society.

36:48.200 --> 36:49.860
We now have four members.

36:49.860 --> 36:53.320
And the fifth member required
to form an official club will be...

36:56.550 --> 36:58.360
Well...

36:58.360 --> 37:02.370
I can't really count a cat as a club member.

37:02.370 --> 37:05.280
But Chimaera is my servant.

37:05.280 --> 37:06.870
Of the same level as Dekomori.

37:07.230 --> 37:08.400
That's right!

37:08.400 --> 37:10.100
We're the same!

37:10.100 --> 37:11.130
You should deny it.

37:11.130 --> 37:12.500
Got a minute?

37:12.500 --> 37:13.550
Wh-What's up?

37:13.550 --> 37:17.220
I was thinking of joining your hobby group.

37:17.220 --> 37:19.510
I just turned in the form to join.

37:19.510 --> 37:21.140
<b>Far East Napping Society</b>

37:23.150 --> 37:23.890
What the heck?

37:24.610 --> 37:27.580
It appears we've summoned the Dark Flame Master.

37:27.580 --> 37:29.480
The Magic Circle of Saturnus is worthy of its reputation.

37:29.480 --> 37:33.150
It continues to summon us various things.

37:33.150 --> 37:34.620
Hey now...

37:35.530 --> 37:37.280
Would you mind explaining this?

37:37.280 --> 37:39.280
What did you do to the floor?!

37:39.280 --> 37:41.300
Have you never seen a magic circle before?

37:41.300 --> 37:43.280
Are you an idiot or something?

37:43.280 --> 37:45.240
I <i>know</i> that much.

37:45.240 --> 37:47.910
I'm asking why you made one on the floor.

37:47.910 --> 37:51.790
I told you during class that we'd be holding a Black Mass.

37:51.790 --> 37:52.760
That's right!

37:52.760 --> 37:55.240
We've even prepared the sacrifice.

37:56.210 --> 37:58.510
Monkey cups so yummy...

37:58.510 --> 37:59.660
Now look here!

37:59.660 --> 38:01.740
You can't bring the cat to school.

38:01.740 --> 38:05.870
We formed this society for the
purpose of finding the Unseen Horizon.

38:05.870 --> 38:07.260
We require Chimaera.

38:07.260 --> 38:08.480
Master, now's the time!

38:08.480 --> 38:11.860
Let us summon something else
in exchange for this sacrifice!

38:11.860 --> 38:13.060
Very well.

38:13.670 --> 38:17.820
In the name of the Tyrant's Eye, I summon thee.

38:17.820 --> 38:20.840
Thy name is Dark Annihilator.

38:20.840 --> 38:24.950
Thy blood, thy flesh, thy bone, all without form.

38:28.390 --> 38:29.950
Let's kick it up a notch.

38:29.950 --> 38:32.210
You're putting way too much effort into this!

38:32.210 --> 38:34.500
Master, that angle is perfect!

38:34.500 --> 38:36.000
Let's do that again!

38:39.350 --> 38:41.260
Master, you're <i>so</i> cool!

38:41.260 --> 38:42.360
Wanna give it a try, Dekomori?

38:42.360 --> 38:44.340
Yeah, you bet I do!

38:45.600 --> 38:47.880
Darkness beyond twilight...

38:47.880 --> 38:50.400
Crimson beyond blood that flows...

38:55.310 --> 38:57.680
Let the fools who stand before me be destroyed!

38:57.680 --> 39:00.070
Dragon Slave!

39:02.870 --> 39:03.780
What happened?

39:04.110 --> 39:06.030
What do you think you're doing?!

39:06.410 --> 39:07.450
Hello!

39:07.450 --> 39:08.950
N-Nibutani?!

39:08.950 --> 39:09.980
What's this?

39:10.770 --> 39:12.960
I-It's nothing!

39:13.710 --> 39:16.260
Wow! Is this a magic circle?

39:16.260 --> 39:19.090
So you guys really <i>are</i> researching magic.

39:19.090 --> 39:19.960
Give it back!

39:19.960 --> 39:21.360
Give it back!

39:23.050 --> 39:24.550
Give it back!

39:25.830 --> 39:27.930
What's wrong with you?

39:27.930 --> 39:29.760
I hear you have a problem.

39:30.610 --> 39:32.020
When did you get there?!

39:32.020 --> 39:35.760
I've searched all night, but I've found no
information regarding the Unseen Horizon.

39:35.760 --> 39:36.600
'Tis a shame.

39:36.600 --> 39:38.610
All I've found is this book.

39:46.610 --> 39:48.820
The Human Realm has corrupted you.

39:48.820 --> 39:50.480
I'm sorry.

39:51.370 --> 39:53.160
What's wrong with me looking at stuff like this?!

39:53.710 --> 39:54.480
You shouldn't!

39:54.480 --> 39:56.980
The Dark Flame Master mustn't look at things like that.

40:03.210 --> 40:04.550
Come on! Where is it?!

40:04.550 --> 40:06.630
Wh-What is she doing?!

40:06.630 --> 40:08.140
Where is it?!

40:09.470 --> 40:10.390
What's this?

40:10.390 --> 40:12.140
Is it in here?

40:13.350 --> 40:16.060
Don't open that!

40:18.990 --> 40:19.900
Where is it?

40:20.250 --> 40:21.360
Where's what?

40:21.360 --> 40:23.800
The Mabinogion that idiot had!

40:23.800 --> 40:24.500
Why do you—

40:24.500 --> 40:25.650
Where is it?!

40:25.650 --> 40:27.530
I think it was...

40:28.830 --> 40:30.500
Oh, here it is.

40:30.500 --> 40:32.290
Man, this thing's pretty heavy.

40:33.830 --> 40:34.870
Wh-What?

40:38.050 --> 40:40.400
Though I have lost my memories,

40:40.400 --> 40:45.010
I am a true mage who has lived for the last 500 years.

40:45.010 --> 40:48.500
This is the story of my life, a life of the faeries' blessing.

40:48.500 --> 40:49.640
My name is...

40:49.640 --> 40:50.510
Mori Summer.

40:50.510 --> 40:52.020
Stop!

40:52.020 --> 40:54.390
I don't... I don't want to hear anymore!

40:54.390 --> 41:00.020
As you may already know, there exists a
white world and a black world within our own.

41:00.020 --> 41:02.150
The shame! The shame! The shame!

41:02.590 --> 41:05.900
I went to the trouble of deleting
<i>each</i> and <i>every</i> post on my blog.

41:06.350 --> 41:09.030
I never imagined that anyone would've printed it out.

41:09.030 --> 41:10.220
Well...

41:10.220 --> 41:12.530
I still can't believe you wrote something like that.

41:12.530 --> 41:15.540
Listen up! If you ever tell <i>anyone</i>, I'll curse you to death!

41:15.540 --> 41:17.440
Wh-What sweltering heat!

41:17.440 --> 41:19.940
It's over 200,005,000 degrees Celsius!

41:19.940 --> 41:21.300
Bear with it, Dekomori.

41:21.300 --> 41:23.000
Just until my incantation is complete.

41:24.830 --> 41:29.120
Unfortunately, the clouds prevented
us from locating the singularity.

41:29.120 --> 41:32.980
And since I came all the way out here, I'd like
to at least take the Mabinogion back with me.

41:32.980 --> 41:34.540
Oh, y-yeah...

41:34.540 --> 41:36.080
Return it to me at once!

41:36.080 --> 41:37.640
Where is it?

41:37.640 --> 41:38.580
Right here.

41:39.890 --> 41:42.150
It's been burnt to ashes.

41:42.150 --> 41:44.020
You're too late.

41:44.410 --> 41:47.580
Now the records are lost for all eternity.

41:47.580 --> 41:49.640
H-How could you...

41:49.640 --> 41:51.840
do something like this?

41:51.840 --> 41:53.460
Hey, you okay?

41:54.370 --> 41:56.640
My precious...

41:59.910 --> 42:00.790
Geh-heh.

42:00.790 --> 42:01.790
"Geh-heh"?

42:01.790 --> 42:03.820
Geh-heh.

42:03.820 --> 42:08.480
Geh-heh-heh-heh-heh.

42:06.910 --> 42:08.200
D-Dekomori?

42:08.480 --> 42:10.360
Geh-heh-heh-heh-heh.

42:10.360 --> 42:12.100
There's nothing to worry about!

42:12.100 --> 42:15.560
I made copies of it, just in case
something like this happened.

42:16.950 --> 42:19.680
Back then, I...

42:21.440 --> 42:24.440
The faeries are whispering to me again.

42:24.440 --> 42:25.480
Die! Die!

42:25.480 --> 42:27.400
I want my old self to die!

42:27.400 --> 42:28.320
That's enough, Nibutani.

42:28.320 --> 42:29.820
The ground hasn't done anything wrong.

42:29.820 --> 42:31.600
Wielder of the Tyrant's Eye,

42:30.480 --> 42:36.080
And so, we welcomed the Fake Mori Summer
into our society and proceeded with our missions.

42:31.600 --> 42:35.350
society member zero, Takanashi Rikka!

42:35.350 --> 42:37.060
Servant of the Tyrant's Eye,

42:37.060 --> 42:38.800
Wielder of the Mjollnir Hammer,

42:38.800 --> 42:42.060
society member zero, Dekomori Sanae!

42:42.060 --> 42:45.460
The Bloodcurdling Light Siesta,

42:45.460 --> 42:48.170
society member zero, Tsuyuri Kumin!

42:48.170 --> 42:49.510
You freaking kid!

42:49.510 --> 42:50.510
That's...

42:50.510 --> 42:51.520
white water!

42:51.520 --> 42:52.510
Who cares?!

42:53.260 --> 42:55.300
Now drink!

42:53.790 --> 42:56.700
Stop! Stop it!

42:55.300 --> 42:56.400
Drink it!

42:56.400 --> 42:57.850
Hang in there, Deko-chan!

42:57.850 --> 43:00.430
Now then, Fake Mori Summer!

43:00.430 --> 43:03.810
I'll DS Drive you straight to
the horizon of infinite energy!

43:04.670 --> 43:08.610
From the Mabinogion, the Rainbow Codex, 3:1.

43:09.650 --> 43:14.780
When the whispers of the faeries and the
dreams of the light and water reach our hearts,

43:14.780 --> 43:17.580
the white world will open to us.

43:17.930 --> 43:22.660
I know, for I have watched this world for 400 years.

43:22.660 --> 43:26.080
What the world needs most...

43:28.000 --> 43:29.210
is love!

43:29.210 --> 43:32.470
Stop! I don't want to hear it!

