44:18.890 --> 44:19.640
<b>Name: Dodomen  Female</b>

44:18.890 --> 44:19.640
<b>Name: Dodomen  Female</b>

44:51.000 --> 44:52.590
We have an emergency on our hands.

44:56.430 --> 44:57.300
Hey...

44:59.490 --> 45:01.050
We don't need background music!

45:01.050 --> 45:02.050
Math?

45:02.450 --> 45:03.600
Yeah.

45:03.600 --> 45:07.060
If she fails the final, the group's getting disbanded.

45:07.060 --> 45:09.580
Really? Sounds good to me.

45:09.580 --> 45:11.720
Not like we're doing anything, anyway.

45:11.720 --> 45:13.070
But it's not good!

45:13.070 --> 45:15.620
We finally have our own Napping Club!

45:15.620 --> 45:18.640
We have to devote our youthful days to it!

45:18.640 --> 45:19.680
Is she asleep?

45:19.680 --> 45:20.320
I think so.

45:21.610 --> 45:24.960
You can devote your youthful days to it on your own.

45:25.770 --> 45:31.000
Mori Summer-chan is chubbier than she looks.

45:32.610 --> 45:34.300
She's an idiot.

45:34.300 --> 45:36.010
I don't want to hear that from you!

45:38.760 --> 45:41.160
By the power of the Tyrant's Eye, I command you:

45:41.160 --> 45:44.520
You shall dedicate your soul, your body, and your bone

45:44.520 --> 45:48.060
to prevent me from receiving a
failing grade on the math final.

45:48.060 --> 45:48.640
Death.

45:48.970 --> 45:50.640
Praying to the gods already?

45:50.640 --> 45:52.260
I am not praying.

45:52.260 --> 45:54.380
I am commanding them by
the power of the Tyrant's Eye.

45:54.380 --> 45:55.300
Death!

45:57.790 --> 45:59.450
Stop it! They'll punish you instead!

45:59.850 --> 46:01.410
Don't worry, Rikka-chan.

46:01.810 --> 46:04.580
When you can't figure out an answer, you can use this!

46:04.580 --> 46:08.220
I'll let you borrow my special pencil!

46:09.120 --> 46:11.500
Question 1: What is the size of the marked angle?

46:17.840 --> 46:18.460
4!

46:18.460 --> 46:19.340
What's the answer?!

46:19.340 --> 46:20.340
3!

46:21.220 --> 46:24.400
Please help Rikka-chan avoid failing her math final.

46:24.400 --> 46:26.680
These two are hopeless.

46:28.180 --> 46:29.680
Let's get this started!

46:30.050 --> 46:32.520
Mjollnir Accel!

46:32.520 --> 46:34.100
Let me explain:

46:34.100 --> 46:41.300
By pumping mana into my lower body, Mjollnir
Accel increases my athletic abilities by 3.88 times,

46:41.300 --> 46:44.400
allowing me to move at inhuman speeds.

46:45.950 --> 46:47.830
This acceleration...

46:47.830 --> 46:48.960
Let's go!

46:48.960 --> 46:50.700
Right to the speed of sound!

46:51.270 --> 46:53.040
I'm gonna crash!

46:53.040 --> 46:55.280
But it's a feint! I stop right before!

46:55.280 --> 46:56.280
Come on.

46:57.190 --> 46:58.920
Just get to work.

46:58.920 --> 47:02.980
Why do <i>I</i> have to do this, anyway?

47:02.980 --> 47:05.760
Nana-chan said all the members have to participate.

47:06.130 --> 47:08.890
I don't remember joining this thing.

47:11.270 --> 47:13.180
You turned in the form to join, right?

47:13.180 --> 47:16.500
That was just to get closer to that kid.

47:16.500 --> 47:18.480
I'm only part of the cheerleading team.

47:18.480 --> 47:20.860
Sorry. My hand slipped.

47:23.670 --> 47:24.600
This is...

47:24.600 --> 47:25.540
GENESIS!

47:25.540 --> 47:27.760
A battle between the old and the new?

47:27.760 --> 47:29.840
You're not making any sense!

47:29.840 --> 47:31.480
Just put down the hose!

47:31.480 --> 47:33.040
I can't do that.

47:34.250 --> 47:35.500
Leave it to me, Dekomori.

47:35.500 --> 47:37.330
I'll lend you my power.

47:37.330 --> 47:38.600
Master!

47:38.600 --> 47:40.590
Evil Eye Shoot!

47:40.590 --> 47:41.900
The power...

47:41.900 --> 47:43.470
I feel the power!

47:44.530 --> 47:46.940
I'm one with the hose!

47:46.940 --> 47:48.890
Out of the way! Out of the way!

47:51.090 --> 47:52.680
I'll ask again.

47:52.680 --> 47:54.770
You're serious about studying, right?

47:54.770 --> 47:56.270
Of course.

47:56.270 --> 47:57.640
Just warning you.

47:57.640 --> 47:59.700
Our school does pretty well on the national exams,

47:59.700 --> 48:03.280
so you'll need to grit your teeth
if you want to get the average.

48:03.280 --> 48:04.900
I know that.

48:04.900 --> 48:07.160
Okay, then I'll help you.

48:07.160 --> 48:09.200
We'll start from an easy question.

48:09.200 --> 48:13.500
What is the probability of rolling a 3 with two dice?

48:13.500 --> 48:14.380
Can you do it?

48:14.380 --> 48:15.620
With ease.

48:15.620 --> 48:19.290
Man, your room's still a mess.

48:19.290 --> 48:20.500
Why don't you clean it up a—

48:22.090 --> 48:23.420
I don't get it.

48:24.050 --> 48:28.680
I thought I'd get it if I knew what a
die-thrower thought, so I drew one.

48:28.680 --> 48:30.140
But it's beyond my comprehension.

48:30.140 --> 48:32.680
I don't know what he's thinking.

48:33.330 --> 48:36.260
In other words, that's the limit of your abilities.

48:36.260 --> 48:37.280
No.

48:37.280 --> 48:39.360
I haven't unleashed my true powers.

48:39.360 --> 48:40.190
You just wanted to say that.

48:40.690 --> 48:42.430
Guess there's no choice.

48:42.430 --> 48:44.740
I'll ask a question from further back.

48:45.270 --> 48:47.570
A-Are we going through everything from that far back?

48:47.570 --> 48:51.850
You need to start from what you <i>do</i> know in math.

48:51.850 --> 48:53.200
Let's see...

48:53.590 --> 48:54.700
Who's there?!

48:55.870 --> 48:56.920
No one's there.

48:56.920 --> 48:57.460
No, there was!

48:59.500 --> 49:01.570
Yuuta, look out!

49:01.570 --> 49:02.980
Not falling for it.

49:04.410 --> 49:07.740
By the way, Yuuta, the magic power in the number 8—

49:07.740 --> 49:09.180
Not falling for that either.

49:10.390 --> 49:13.010
You just sucked your teeth at me!

49:13.010 --> 49:13.850
Sit!

49:15.470 --> 49:17.950
You said you were serious about studying, right?

49:17.950 --> 49:18.770
I am.

49:19.090 --> 49:21.860
You said you were really going to
study and asked me to help, right?

49:22.290 --> 49:23.220
I did.

49:23.910 --> 49:24.650
But...

49:24.650 --> 49:26.500
I just can't do math!

49:26.500 --> 49:28.900
I don't know what they're thinking!

49:28.900 --> 49:33.240
What's the point of knowing the probability
of rolling something in dice in the first place?!

49:33.240 --> 49:34.410
Don't make a valid argument!

49:35.510 --> 49:38.250
I don't get it!

49:42.530 --> 49:44.380
Yuuta, your code is so cool!

49:45.070 --> 49:46.580
Cool?

49:46.580 --> 49:47.920
It's just a normal—

49:46.970 --> 49:50.720
E-mail Address

49:48.750 --> 49:50.340
Crap!

49:50.720 --> 49:52.180
I left my old address on here!

49:52.180 --> 49:54.420
Divine Exseed Freya Magna!

49:54.420 --> 49:55.180
Quit it!

49:55.180 --> 49:56.750
Don't say it out loud!

49:56.750 --> 49:58.900
I'm changing it right now. Hold on.

49:58.900 --> 49:59.770
No.

49:59.770 --> 50:01.500
Mine is more normal.

