50:01.500 --> 50:02.680
I'm changing <i>mine</i>.

50:03.110 --> 50:04.480
Oh, I know, Yuuta!

50:04.480 --> 50:06.110
You choose my code!

50:07.050 --> 50:09.300
I know you'll come up with a good one!

50:09.300 --> 50:12.460
No, I think yours is just fine.

50:13.350 --> 50:14.920
Then I'll use your code.

50:14.920 --> 50:15.780
No, you can't!

50:15.780 --> 50:18.920
And are you sure about just changing it like that?

50:18.920 --> 50:19.940
Why not?

50:19.940 --> 50:26.080
I mean, don't you need to tell your friends from
middle school and your family if you change it?

50:26.080 --> 50:27.320
No problem.

50:27.320 --> 50:30.020
I only need to tell the Priestess and Dekomori.

50:30.560 --> 50:31.510
Really?

50:32.050 --> 50:36.760
In this universe, they are the only
beings that acknowledge my presence.

50:44.290 --> 50:50.400
But if you choose one for me,
I'll tell you, Nibutani, and Kumin, too.

50:56.070 --> 50:57.410
Come here.

50:57.410 --> 50:58.620
But the lizardtail tea...

50:59.850 --> 51:02.880
I'm teaching you everything
before that final comes around.

51:02.880 --> 51:04.710
So you'd better give it everything you've got.

51:05.070 --> 51:06.140
Yuuta...

51:07.070 --> 51:09.220
It took a lot to make the group.

51:10.950 --> 51:13.970
If you can get above average on the final...

51:14.430 --> 51:18.720
I'll think up a protocol code you might like.

51:23.370 --> 51:24.730
Crap.

51:25.350 --> 51:27.780
I didn't study enough myself.

51:31.740 --> 51:33.460
Guess that's that.

51:33.460 --> 51:35.990
You guys didn't do too well.

51:35.990 --> 51:38.990
The average was 50.

51:39.330 --> 51:40.740
Better study harder.

51:46.810 --> 51:48.440
What power!

51:48.440 --> 51:51.010
Walk normally for a change.

51:51.010 --> 51:52.970
Oh, right! I almost forgot!

51:52.970 --> 51:55.300
Yuuta, my protocol code!

51:55.300 --> 51:57.180
Huh? What are you talking about?

51:59.910 --> 52:01.970
I'm kidding! I thought one up for you!

52:01.970 --> 52:03.800
I'm only doing it today, okay?

52:08.770 --> 52:10.860
Wielder of the Tyrant's Eye!

52:11.190 --> 52:13.740
In honor of your efforts and achievement,

52:13.740 --> 52:20.320
I, the Dark Flame Master, have gathered the
powers of darkness to create a fitting code for you!

52:20.320 --> 52:22.740
May you carve it into your soul!

52:23.290 --> 52:24.820
Protocol code...

52:25.470 --> 52:27.100
Inscribe!

