52:30.840 --> 52:31.970
Togashi Yuuta

52:30.840 --> 52:31.970
Received Message

52:31.960 --> 52:35.720
"Black raison d'être."

52:35.720 --> 52:38.540
It means "black reason for existence."

52:38.540 --> 52:40.600
The code fits you, does it not?

52:40.600 --> 52:42.120
It's so cool...

52:42.120 --> 52:43.680
It's so cool, Yuuta!

52:44.250 --> 52:45.350
Naturally.

52:46.250 --> 52:48.400
How long am I going to keep this up?

52:50.030 --> 52:50.730
Hey!

52:51.130 --> 52:52.200
Wait a—

52:53.230 --> 52:53.350
Thanks

52:53.360 --> 52:53.480
Thanks

52:53.480 --> 52:53.610
Thanks

52:53.610 --> 52:53.730
Thanks

52:53.730 --> 52:53.860
Thanks

52:53.860 --> 52:54.360
Thanks

52:54.360 --> 52:56.360
Thanks.

53:05.160 --> 53:08.290
Something happened after that,
but I don't remember what.

53:09.750 --> 53:12.880
Dark Limited Unknown Shield!

53:12.880 --> 53:15.260
Equipped! Ker-wink!

53:16.510 --> 53:18.020
Summer arrived,

53:18.020 --> 53:24.060
and the Tyrant's Eye slowly transformed as
a result of Administration Bureau attacks.

53:25.720 --> 53:28.040
Trainsick already?

53:28.040 --> 53:30.340
What did I tell you? She's totally a first-grader.

53:30.340 --> 53:32.190
Sh-Shut u—

53:34.050 --> 53:36.820
Stop fighting and look outside.
Focus on the distant greenery.

53:36.820 --> 53:38.560
Shut up.

53:39.250 --> 53:44.740
Now is the time to open the
Mabinogion and purge myself of the beast!

53:44.740 --> 53:45.540
My heart—

53:47.000 --> 53:48.790
We're almost there.

53:53.270 --> 53:54.000
Hey.

53:55.290 --> 53:56.260
Rikka.

53:59.890 --> 54:00.630
What?

54:03.810 --> 54:05.390
That's all you have to say?!

54:08.060 --> 54:11.460
Mori Summer-chan, that's a nice two-piece!

54:11.460 --> 54:13.940
What's up with you?

54:13.940 --> 54:15.880
Even your swimsuit's completely white.

54:15.880 --> 54:18.360
Well, it's the only one I had.

54:18.360 --> 54:19.900
How do I look?

54:23.410 --> 54:27.120
The Kraken lurks in these waters!

54:27.120 --> 54:31.120
Now is the time to test the power
of this mage's shroud in sea battle!

54:31.120 --> 54:33.290
Behold!

54:36.070 --> 54:41.300
That mage's shroud increases your
mobility by 3.88 times, even in water.

54:41.300 --> 54:43.080
Ow! Ow! Ow!

54:43.080 --> 54:45.120
You can move 3.88 times faster.

54:45.120 --> 54:46.310
Ow! Ow! Ow!

54:46.310 --> 54:48.430
Come on. Go test it.

54:48.430 --> 54:50.810
I'll get you back for this!

54:51.370 --> 54:52.810
She <i>is</i> moving faster.

54:55.400 --> 54:57.600
Thanks for the meal!

55:00.270 --> 55:02.200
Is there cheese in this salad?!

55:02.200 --> 55:04.560
Deko-chan, you can't eat cheese either?

55:04.560 --> 55:08.660
Who could eat something that reeks of rotting rags?

55:08.660 --> 55:10.400
It's made from milk.

55:10.400 --> 55:12.560
Milk is rotten!

55:12.560 --> 55:14.370
The root of all evil!

55:13.370 --> 55:14.370
Eat it.

55:16.390 --> 55:17.540
Eat it.

55:17.540 --> 55:19.300
B-But milk...

55:19.300 --> 55:20.400
Eat it.

55:21.170 --> 55:22.050
Okay.

55:22.890 --> 55:24.550
You're amazing, Deko-chan!

55:27.350 --> 55:28.720
What's the password?

55:30.310 --> 55:32.280
The Tyrant's Eye is the strongest.

55:34.730 --> 55:35.520
No.

55:35.520 --> 55:36.820
It's not?!

55:36.820 --> 55:40.730
It appears you've suffered a
mental attack from the Priestess.

55:40.730 --> 55:43.400
You are not Yuuta.

55:43.400 --> 55:45.180
Is that what you think?

55:45.890 --> 55:47.020
Ease your heart.

55:47.020 --> 55:49.660
I was once the Dark Flame Master.

55:51.690 --> 55:52.410
Are you sure?

55:53.480 --> 55:55.820
Didn't you want to search for the Unseen Horizon?

56:08.990 --> 56:09.930
You'll help?

56:14.170 --> 56:15.810
Why would I lie now?

56:15.810 --> 56:17.300
W-Well...

56:17.300 --> 56:20.690
Mama, Onee-chan, Grandpa, and Grandma, they all...

56:21.070 --> 56:22.820
That's why you asked me, right?

56:23.590 --> 56:24.820
Yuuta...

56:24.820 --> 56:25.940
O-Onee—

56:26.770 --> 56:29.200
The Priestess is on guard now.

56:29.200 --> 56:31.200
Evading her sight won't be easy.

56:31.200 --> 56:32.620
So you don't want to go?

56:35.610 --> 56:36.460
When are we going?

56:37.750 --> 56:39.220
R-Right now!

56:40.570 --> 56:41.210
Right now?

56:41.590 --> 56:43.210
Yeah. Right now.

56:50.950 --> 56:53.520
I never thought you'd help her.

56:53.990 --> 56:55.560
What do you plan to do?

56:55.560 --> 56:58.280
Who knows? I, for one, don't.

56:58.280 --> 57:00.080
That line was pretty cool!

57:00.080 --> 57:01.520
Whatever. Just keep quiet.

57:01.520 --> 57:04.970
Honestly... I should have known...

57:04.970 --> 57:05.780
You're a threat.

57:06.170 --> 57:07.000
Yuuta!

57:17.770 --> 57:18.870
Rikka!

57:19.270 --> 57:19.960
Come on!

57:20.570 --> 57:21.210
Come on!

57:21.210 --> 57:22.340
Rikka!

57:22.730 --> 57:23.920
Jump!

57:46.150 --> 57:48.900
Avalon Smasher!

57:48.900 --> 57:51.450
How long are you going to keep acting like this?

57:59.050 --> 58:00.000
Is it fun?

58:02.370 --> 58:07.130
Is it fun acting like a selfish little kid?

58:08.470 --> 58:10.880
Gun Twinkle!

58:22.550 --> 58:24.480
Do you hate Mama?

58:25.270 --> 58:26.230
No.

58:26.940 --> 58:29.320
Are you trying to make things
difficult for Grandpa and Grandma?

58:31.890 --> 58:32.660
No!

58:32.660 --> 58:35.620
You know well enough that there's nothing you can do!

58:35.620 --> 58:37.160
That you have to accept it!

58:38.910 --> 58:40.940
What do you <i>want</i>?

58:41.560 --> 58:42.920
There's nothing we can do.

58:43.240 --> 58:44.440
Evil Eye.

58:44.920 --> 58:45.750
Stop that!

59:04.290 --> 59:05.480
Yuuta?!

59:07.990 --> 59:10.700
Jeez. I almost didn't make it.

59:11.210 --> 59:12.600
Why are you here?

59:12.600 --> 59:14.640
I should be asking you that.

59:14.640 --> 59:15.910
Where do you think you're going?

59:17.610 --> 59:21.300
The Administration Bureau holds
too much influence in this area.

59:21.300 --> 59:23.170
The barrier is far too strong.

59:23.690 --> 59:24.560
I'm retreating.

59:25.650 --> 59:27.170
So you're going home?

59:34.590 --> 59:35.640
Yuuta.

59:37.730 --> 59:42.230
Where did you find the power of the Dark Flame?

59:42.670 --> 59:44.560
I told you, it doesn't—

59:54.150 --> 59:55.820
Go away!

59:55.820 --> 59:58.030
What's wrong? Interference from
the Administration Bureau?

59:58.470 --> 59:59.280
No.

59:59.890 --> 01:00:01.120
Hey, why—

01:00:01.120 --> 01:00:02.380
Our eyes met.

01:00:02.380 --> 01:00:02.870
Huh?

01:00:15.710 --> 01:00:20.760
Now we are bound by an even
stronger contract, Dark Flame Master.

01:00:20.760 --> 01:00:21.680
Whatever you say.

01:00:21.680 --> 01:00:23.660
Be engulfed by the Dark Flame—

01:00:23.660 --> 01:00:24.770
Stop that!

01:00:33.710 --> 01:00:36.000
It's gotten pretty late.

01:00:36.000 --> 01:00:38.370
Yuuta! I can't get into my room!

01:00:38.990 --> 01:00:44.870
m 151.5 183 l 268.5 75 288 121.5 177 232.5

01:00:38.990 --> 01:00:44.870
Takanashi

01:00:40.890 --> 01:00:42.840
The code has been changed!

01:00:42.840 --> 01:00:44.870
You just forgot to bring your key.

01:00:45.210 --> 01:00:47.620
Man... Guess there's no other option.

01:00:49.430 --> 01:00:51.220
Thank you very much.

01:00:56.350 --> 01:00:58.420
Sure this is all you want?

01:00:57.800 --> 01:00:57.930
<b>Bonito</b>

