<b>Bonito</b>

01:00:58.560 --> 01:00:58.680
<b>Bonito</b>

01:00:58.680 --> 01:00:58.810
<b>Bonito</b>

01:00:58.680 --> 01:00:58.810
<b>Bonito</b>

01:00:58.810 --> 01:00:58.890
<b>Bonito</b>

01:00:58.810 --> 01:00:58.880
<b>Bonito</b>

01:00:58.890 --> 01:01:01.660
I saw you eating one at school.

01:01:01.660 --> 01:01:04.290
I grew curious of their assembly.

01:01:04.290 --> 01:01:07.780
You pull this down to split the skin...

01:01:07.780 --> 01:01:09.920
Take both sides and pull them apart.

01:01:10.710 --> 01:01:11.940
That's so cool.

01:01:11.940 --> 01:01:13.730
<i>That's</i> cool?

01:01:19.430 --> 01:01:20.740
It's good.

01:01:21.290 --> 01:01:23.600
Touka-san'd kill me if she saw you.

01:01:24.270 --> 01:01:26.330
Here. Have some fried chicken.

01:01:30.730 --> 01:01:32.000
The taste of adventure.

01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:33.260
What kind of taste is that?

01:01:33.950 --> 01:01:35.510
What does yours taste like?

01:01:36.050 --> 01:01:37.590
Wanna see for yourself?

01:01:37.590 --> 01:01:38.300
Here.

01:01:42.010 --> 01:01:43.040
Too spicy for you?

01:01:43.040 --> 01:01:44.360
Yuuta!

01:01:44.360 --> 01:01:45.470
Sorry, sorry.

01:01:47.390 --> 01:01:49.430
Mana replenished.

01:01:49.430 --> 01:01:51.500
All right. Let's go home.

01:02:01.910 --> 01:02:02.900
Yuuta.

01:02:04.230 --> 01:02:05.660
I don't want to go home.

01:02:06.660 --> 01:02:09.020
I want to bask in the moonlight.

01:02:09.770 --> 01:02:10.460
Hey!

01:02:12.330 --> 01:02:16.060
Yuuta, is this the Mjollnir Hammer?

01:02:20.170 --> 01:02:22.140
How do you think these things up?

01:02:22.140 --> 01:02:23.390
Come on. It's late.

01:02:24.170 --> 01:02:26.640
You can sleep in this room, so brush your teeth and—

01:02:28.630 --> 01:02:30.310
It smells like Yuuta.

01:02:31.030 --> 01:02:32.440
S-Stop!

01:02:32.820 --> 01:02:34.060
Why?

01:02:34.770 --> 01:02:36.860
It smells like Yuuta.

01:02:38.820 --> 01:02:39.960
Just stop!

01:02:39.960 --> 01:02:41.320
It's embarrassing!

01:02:42.890 --> 01:02:44.070
I'm turning off the light.

01:02:44.870 --> 01:02:47.860
Night is when the Tyrant's Eye is most active!

01:02:47.860 --> 01:02:48.320
It is already—

01:02:48.320 --> 01:02:49.200
Just go to sleep.

01:02:59.910 --> 01:03:01.470
I told you to sleep.

01:03:01.470 --> 01:03:03.260
My heart is filled with unease.

01:03:03.260 --> 01:03:05.200
They may be close.

01:03:05.200 --> 01:03:06.470
We must be on guard.

01:03:06.470 --> 01:03:07.800
Look...

01:03:14.850 --> 01:03:15.480
I'm turning it off.

01:03:15.850 --> 01:03:17.480
My heart is filled with unease.

01:03:17.480 --> 01:03:19.360
It'll go away if you sleep.

01:03:19.360 --> 01:03:20.680
My heart is pounding.

01:03:20.680 --> 01:03:21.820
That'll go away too.

01:03:21.820 --> 01:03:23.060
I'm excited!

01:03:23.060 --> 01:03:24.780
This isn't a theme park commercial!

01:03:24.780 --> 01:03:26.040
I'm gonna explode!

01:03:26.040 --> 01:03:26.910
Why?!

01:03:26.910 --> 01:03:28.200
I don't know!

01:03:31.470 --> 01:03:33.460
Wh-Whatever. Just go to sleep.

01:03:35.080 --> 01:03:35.940
Wait!

01:03:37.540 --> 01:03:38.760
Hey...

01:03:40.150 --> 01:03:41.600
Don't go...

01:03:44.630 --> 01:03:47.640
Yuuta, close your eyes.

01:03:47.640 --> 01:03:48.350
Huh?!

01:03:48.350 --> 01:03:50.020
Just for a second.

01:03:50.020 --> 01:03:52.560
Just do it for a second.

01:04:17.710 --> 01:04:19.460
What's this?

01:04:19.460 --> 01:04:21.840
A piece of powerful magic.

01:04:21.840 --> 01:04:23.800
It's a symbol of our new contract.

01:04:26.290 --> 01:04:28.800
Could you put it somewhere less conspicuous?

01:04:28.800 --> 01:04:31.010
It's best here.

01:04:31.010 --> 01:04:33.640
With this, your powers of darkness are multiplied.

01:04:33.640 --> 01:04:37.560
You can unleash the Dark Buster,
which is even stronger than the Dark Flame.

01:04:42.010 --> 01:04:42.900
I'm going to bed.

01:04:46.810 --> 01:04:48.770
My heart is pounding.

01:04:48.770 --> 01:04:50.030
This presence...

01:04:57.330 --> 01:04:57.920
Who goes there?!

01:05:29.490 --> 01:05:30.440
Yuuta.

01:05:35.290 --> 01:05:36.320
Kumin.

01:05:37.430 --> 01:05:38.410
Kumin?

01:05:39.550 --> 01:05:41.700
Oh, Rikka-chan!

01:05:41.700 --> 01:05:42.860
Are you okay?

01:05:42.860 --> 01:05:44.780
Has the spatial corruption affected you too?

01:05:45.320 --> 01:05:46.520
Corruption?

01:05:47.090 --> 01:05:50.180
I was just napping here since it's so nice out today.

01:05:50.180 --> 01:05:51.420
No.

01:05:52.180 --> 01:05:57.180
You're being influenced by spatial
corruption brought about by a dark singularity.

01:05:57.180 --> 01:06:00.400
Both Yuuta and I...

01:06:01.310 --> 01:06:03.190
We need to do something about this.

01:06:05.910 --> 01:06:07.350
Rikka?

01:06:07.350 --> 01:06:08.320
Are you here?

01:06:13.380 --> 01:06:15.380
What do you want at this hour?

01:06:16.110 --> 01:06:17.100
Yuuta.

01:06:17.100 --> 01:06:17.830
What?

01:06:19.530 --> 01:06:20.580
I'm sorry.

01:06:20.910 --> 01:06:22.240
What?

01:06:22.240 --> 01:06:24.090
You called me out here just to say that?

01:06:25.630 --> 01:06:27.130
I shall defeat you!

01:06:30.290 --> 01:06:31.860
I can see it!

01:06:31.860 --> 01:06:33.320
The singularity!

01:06:33.320 --> 01:06:35.080
What's going on here?!

01:06:35.080 --> 01:06:40.500
Yuuta, the Administration Bureau has
planted a dark singularity within you!

01:06:40.500 --> 01:06:42.100
We shall remove it!

01:06:42.100 --> 01:06:42.770
Master!

01:06:44.010 --> 01:06:45.260
Reality, be rent!

01:06:45.260 --> 01:06:46.860
Synapse, break!

01:06:46.860 --> 01:06:49.320
Vanishment, this world!

01:06:53.930 --> 01:06:55.200
Huh?

01:06:56.350 --> 01:06:57.220
Master!

01:06:57.220 --> 01:06:58.720
We have no choice! On to Plan B!

01:06:58.720 --> 01:06:59.440
Dekomori!

01:06:59.440 --> 01:07:00.420
Master!

01:07:02.460 --> 01:07:03.460
What will you do now?

01:07:03.460 --> 01:07:05.020
Can you tell us apart?

01:07:05.020 --> 01:07:06.090
I'm Rikka.

01:07:06.090 --> 01:07:07.460
I'm Dekomori.

01:07:07.460 --> 01:07:08.560
Who's Rikka?

01:07:08.560 --> 01:07:10.380
And who's Master?

01:07:15.790 --> 01:07:16.640
Too easy.

01:07:17.990 --> 01:07:18.880
You fell for it!

01:07:18.880 --> 01:07:20.390
That was the real one!

01:07:20.770 --> 01:07:22.940
So the master saved the body double?

01:07:23.730 --> 01:07:25.520
Shoot! You're right!

01:07:27.020 --> 01:07:30.120
Seriously, what's the point of all this?

01:07:30.120 --> 01:07:32.150
I was really worried about you.

01:07:32.150 --> 01:07:33.530
You okay?

01:07:33.990 --> 01:07:34.720
Come on.

01:07:44.670 --> 01:07:45.920
What's the matter?

01:08:16.240 --> 01:08:17.220
Love?

01:08:17.220 --> 01:08:19.240
Yeah. Haven't you noticed?

01:08:19.240 --> 01:08:22.250
You're in love with Togashi-kun.

01:08:24.630 --> 01:08:25.790
Whoa! I'm sure of it now.

01:08:34.050 --> 01:08:36.840
T-Takanashi-san, are you okay?

01:08:36.840 --> 01:08:38.880
The Tyrant's Eye is the strongest.

01:08:38.880 --> 01:08:42.420
I am already bound to Yuuta by the highest contract.

01:08:43.010 --> 01:08:45.920
We have no need of a lesser contract
such as "boyfriend and girlfriend."

01:08:45.920 --> 01:08:49.360
