you're with Togashi-kun, right?

01:08:49.910 --> 01:08:51.980
Don't you imagine things when you're at home?

01:08:51.980 --> 01:08:54.570
Like walking hand in hand?

01:08:54.570 --> 01:08:56.520
Or kissing?

01:08:58.250 --> 01:09:02.140
