01:10:46.510 --> 01:10:47.350
Rikka!

01:10:47.690 --> 01:10:48.310
Yuuta!

01:10:57.690 --> 01:10:58.730
Damn it!

01:11:01.350 --> 01:11:02.340
Wait for me.

01:11:10.490 --> 01:11:12.290
Move! Move! Move!

01:11:18.990 --> 01:11:20.460
I've got you!

01:11:21.190 --> 01:11:22.340
Easy now...

01:11:22.730 --> 01:11:23.800
Easy...

01:11:24.710 --> 01:11:26.240
You can let go now.

01:11:35.570 --> 01:11:37.660
H-Hey...

01:11:36.410 --> 01:11:37.660
Yuuta!

01:11:40.400 --> 01:11:42.490
Yuuta! Yuuta! Yuuta!

01:11:43.070 --> 01:11:44.240
Rikka?

01:11:44.570 --> 01:11:46.910
I... I...

01:12:02.340 --> 01:12:04.090
<b>Oriental Magick Napping Society In Summer</b>

01:12:08.600 --> 01:12:09.880
Master!

01:12:12.970 --> 01:12:17.620
Will the Magician's Night rise as the darkness falls?

01:12:19.070 --> 01:12:20.150
Master?

01:12:37.430 --> 01:12:38.250
Master?

01:12:39.830 --> 01:12:42.090
What is it, Master?

01:12:42.910 --> 01:12:44.320
Wait a minute...

01:12:44.320 --> 01:12:46.420
Master, do you...

01:12:50.790 --> 01:12:52.400
Master, you mustn't!

01:12:52.400 --> 01:12:54.350
I am your servant.

01:12:54.350 --> 01:12:57.640
Such emotions are forbidden!

01:12:58.150 --> 01:13:05.340
Though everyone knows that the more
taboo something is, the more stimulating it is...

01:13:13.570 --> 01:13:14.760
Master?

01:13:15.330 --> 01:13:18.080
I was locked in embrace with Yuuta.

01:13:18.960 --> 01:13:20.460
I love Yuuta.

01:13:20.460 --> 01:13:21.960
Master?

01:13:23.350 --> 01:13:25.920
How dare they create a fake Master?!

01:13:25.920 --> 01:13:29.140
First a fake Mori Summer, and now a fake Master?

01:13:30.130 --> 01:13:31.470
Your true master.

01:13:32.170 --> 01:13:34.800
In other words, that means...

01:13:35.730 --> 01:13:39.310
You've fallen to the Dark Flame Master...

01:13:39.650 --> 01:13:42.520
...i-in love?

01:13:47.010 --> 01:13:51.360
Master, there is somewhere I
must go. I shall take my leave.

01:13:51.870 --> 01:13:52.720
Dekomori.

01:13:52.720 --> 01:13:53.700
Don't stop me!

01:13:54.090 --> 01:13:59.290
As your servant, I must deliver
darkness upon those who steal your—

01:13:59.710 --> 01:14:01.170
What should I do?

01:14:09.990 --> 01:14:13.300
You said the Dark Flame 
Master's presence

01:14:13.300 --> 01:14:17.160
was the reason you could
maintain the Tyrant's Eye this long.

01:14:18.880 --> 01:14:24.060
I'm sure the Dark Flame Master
senses those powerful emotions as well.

01:14:24.060 --> 01:14:25.230
You think so?

01:14:25.230 --> 01:14:28.740
I've served you for over two years now.

01:14:28.740 --> 01:14:32.820
A servant knows everything about her master!

01:14:32.820 --> 01:14:34.160
Dekomori...

01:14:34.830 --> 01:14:37.740
There's no need to worry.

01:14:37.740 --> 01:14:40.220
The Tyrant's Eye is the strongest.

01:14:40.220 --> 01:14:42.540
I'm sure it'll be fine.

01:15:04.050 --> 01:15:06.720
By my contract, I command thee.

01:15:06.720 --> 01:15:09.320
By my contract, I command thee.

01:15:09.320 --> 01:15:12.300
By my contract, I command thee.

01:15:12.300 --> 01:15:13.600
What's that?

01:15:13.600 --> 01:15:14.800
A sorcerer's stone.

01:15:14.800 --> 01:15:16.220
It grants wishes.

01:15:16.220 --> 01:15:17.880
Dekomori gave it to me.

01:15:17.880 --> 01:15:18.780
Wishes?

01:15:21.660 --> 01:15:23.620
I can't tell you my wish.

01:15:23.620 --> 01:15:25.720
I never asked what it was.

01:15:31.090 --> 01:15:32.300
You dropped it.

01:15:32.300 --> 01:15:34.340
Wow, it's hot.

01:15:34.340 --> 01:15:37.510
A sorcerer's stone emits heat
in response to a strong wish.

01:15:37.510 --> 01:15:38.140
In other words—

01:15:38.850 --> 01:15:40.160
No!

01:15:42.690 --> 01:15:44.060
Ow...

01:15:58.870 --> 01:16:02.040
I can't just let it drag on like this.

01:16:04.830 --> 01:16:05.840
Hey.

01:16:08.430 --> 01:16:09.210
Hey.

01:16:11.690 --> 01:16:13.970
Schwarzsechs Prototype Mark II!

01:16:13.970 --> 01:16:16.000
Do you <i>have</i> to say the full name every time?

01:16:17.010 --> 01:16:17.720
Wait!

01:16:25.210 --> 01:16:26.380
What is it?

01:16:26.380 --> 01:16:27.650
The lights.

01:16:28.350 --> 01:16:31.220
The lights are moving.

01:16:44.390 --> 01:16:45.210
Rikka—

01:16:45.210 --> 01:16:47.420
I love you, Yuuta.

01:16:54.720 --> 01:16:59.080
I love you, Yuuta.

01:17:02.150 --> 01:17:03.160
W-Wait a second!

01:17:03.160 --> 01:17:04.100
I'm supposed to tell you first!

01:17:04.100 --> 01:17:05.080
No.

01:17:05.080 --> 01:17:08.150
I get to go first by the power of the Tyrant's Eye.

01:17:09.780 --> 01:17:12.360
But I'm the Dark Flame Master!

01:17:14.130 --> 01:17:16.490
The Tyrant's Eye is the strongest.

01:17:23.030 --> 01:17:24.910
No way! That didn't count!

01:17:25.630 --> 01:17:28.290
I even thought up a cool line too. I'll say it now.

01:17:28.290 --> 01:17:29.380
Okay.

01:17:30.850 --> 01:17:33.540
You, engulfed by the Dark Flame!

01:17:33.540 --> 01:17:35.920
Be joined with the Dark Flame
Master by the contract of lo—

01:17:39.810 --> 01:17:40.700
Never mind.

01:17:40.700 --> 01:17:41.160
Anyway—

01:17:41.160 --> 01:17:42.300
Keep going.

01:17:43.490 --> 01:17:44.810
Yuuta.

01:17:49.520 --> 01:17:51.650
You, engulfed by the Dark Flame.

01:17:52.490 --> 01:17:56.900
Be joined with the Dark Flame
Master by the contract of lovers.

01:18:00.390 --> 01:18:01.240
Okay.

01:18:08.010 --> 01:18:11.060
Don't you normally do this kind of thing face to face?

01:18:13.810 --> 01:18:15.040
Too embarrassing?

01:18:15.040 --> 01:18:15.740
Yeah.

01:18:16.970 --> 01:18:18.130
Then how about holding hands?

01:18:21.890 --> 01:18:23.810
Just the pinky.

01:18:23.810 --> 01:18:26.060
Then just pinkies?

01:18:26.060 --> 01:18:27.270
Yeah.

01:18:37.900 --> 01:18:39.280
Coming!

01:18:40.090 --> 01:18:43.280
G-G-G-Good morning!

01:18:44.190 --> 01:18:47.260
She said to change how I talk too.

01:18:47.260 --> 01:18:48.560
Really?

01:18:48.560 --> 01:18:50.980
That is correct, Yuuta-kun.

01:18:52.350 --> 01:18:54.700
Is there anything you require?

01:18:54.700 --> 01:18:55.580
You're not a maid.

01:18:55.580 --> 01:18:57.080
Might there be something you need?

01:18:57.080 --> 01:18:58.300
You're not a rich girl either.

01:18:58.690 --> 01:18:59.920
What do you want?

01:18:59.920 --> 01:19:01.300
Please, anything but that.

01:19:01.300 --> 01:19:02.380
What?

01:19:03.850 --> 01:19:05.930
That's more like it.

01:19:05.930 --> 01:19:07.200
You'll make me embarrassed too.

01:19:07.200 --> 01:19:08.820
Halt.

01:19:10.250 --> 01:19:11.120
Morning.

01:19:11.120 --> 01:19:12.600
Don't you "Morning" me!

01:19:12.600 --> 01:19:17.360
Today is the day that I banish the
demon possessing Master's spirit!

01:19:18.230 --> 01:19:19.720
Reality, be rent!

01:19:19.720 --> 01:19:21.240
Synapse, break!

01:19:21.240 --> 01:19:24.620
Vanishment, this world!

01:19:25.960 --> 01:19:26.830
Master!

01:19:26.830 --> 01:19:27.950
I'm...

01:19:27.950 --> 01:19:30.080
Open your eyes!

01:19:31.330 --> 01:19:32.500
...done with that.

01:19:40.490 --> 01:19:41.660
Master...

01:19:43.760 --> 01:19:44.760
Master...

01:19:46.600 --> 01:19:48.340
It's okay.

01:19:49.060 --> 01:19:52.600
Get out of my way...

01:19:58.650 --> 01:19:59.570
But...

01:20:00.510 --> 01:20:04.800
That was when the Dark Flame Master fully awakened.

01:20:06.320 --> 01:20:07.480
Tails?

01:20:09.710 --> 01:20:11.200
Guess I've got no choice.

01:20:18.630 --> 01:20:22.550
Rikka!

01:20:23.190 --> 01:20:24.360
Yuuta?

01:20:35.350 --> 01:20:37.600
I need to water them.

01:21:03.760 --> 01:21:04.720
Yuuta?!

01:21:07.850 --> 01:21:09.140
I am not Yuuta!

01:21:18.150 --> 01:21:19.400
Yuuta!

01:21:20.050 --> 01:21:21.680
Takanashi Rikka...

01:21:21.680 --> 01:21:23.560
No, the Tyrant's Eye!

01:21:24.670 --> 01:21:26.740
There is something I must show you.

01:21:27.170 --> 01:21:28.240
Yuuta...

01:21:38.870 --> 01:21:39.940
Be bound...

01:21:41.340 --> 01:21:43.250
to me by contract!

01:21:44.630 --> 01:21:45.550
Who's there?!

01:21:45.550 --> 01:21:46.670
A thief?!

01:21:46.670 --> 01:21:48.300
What the hell are you doing?!

01:21:48.300 --> 01:21:48.960
Crap!

01:21:48.960 --> 01:21:49.900
Grandma, the gun!

01:21:49.900 --> 01:21:50.890
Bring me the gun!

01:21:50.890 --> 01:21:52.060
Rikka! Come on!

01:21:52.590 --> 01:21:53.140
But...

01:21:53.140 --> 01:21:55.180
Do you want to stay in this boring reality?!

01:21:55.180 --> 01:21:59.060
Or do you want to come with
me and change that reality?!

01:22:02.600 --> 01:22:03.700
Yuuta!

01:22:05.730 --> 01:22:06.280
Grandma!

01:22:06.280 --> 01:22:06.940
Rikka!

01:22:08.400 --> 01:22:09.200
Yuuta!

01:22:09.200 --> 01:22:10.280
Rikka!

01:22:16.950 --> 01:22:17.900
Rikka!

01:22:32.330 --> 01:22:33.960
The lights...

01:22:33.960 --> 01:22:35.430
Pretty, aren't they?

01:22:38.030 --> 01:22:40.310
But those are just ship lights.

01:22:40.790 --> 01:22:42.680
Normal, electric lights.

01:22:46.410 --> 01:22:47.440
Get off.

01:22:53.170 --> 01:22:54.530
Behold the power of darkness.

01:22:57.810 --> 01:22:59.410
Reality, be rent.

01:23:00.390 --> 01:23:02.370
Synapse, break.

01:23:03.270 --> 01:23:04.960
Vanishment,

01:23:05.500 --> 01:23:06.420
this

01:23:06.420 --> 01:23:09.510
world!

01:23:22.640 --> 01:23:23.640
Yuuta...

01:23:25.650 --> 01:23:27.620
This is the Unseen Horizon.

01:23:28.550 --> 01:23:30.530
Those lights are watching you.

01:23:31.210 --> 01:23:32.320
Tell him.

01:23:32.930 --> 01:23:34.660
What you wanted to say.

01:23:35.550 --> 01:23:39.290
What you never had a chance to say.

01:23:43.290 --> 01:23:44.920
Good-bye.

01:23:53.670 --> 01:23:55.090
Good-bye, Papa!

01:24:05.820 --> 01:24:07.780
Good-bye!

01:24:32.450 --> 01:24:33.060
Yuuta...

01:24:33.060 --> 01:24:34.080
Crap! Run for it!

01:24:34.680 --> 01:24:36.720
You, on the bicycle! Stop!

01:24:37.530 --> 01:24:40.040
You two on the bicycle! Stop!

01:24:40.040 --> 01:24:40.720
Stop!

01:25:10.110 --> 01:25:15.470
And so, the Dark Flame Master
embarked to fight the final battle?

01:25:15.910 --> 01:25:18.960
To face the Administration Bureau,
which continues to meddle in our affairs

01:25:18.960 --> 01:25:22.150
though we have uncovered the Unseen Horizon.

01:25:22.150 --> 01:25:23.470
I must join him!

01:25:23.470 --> 01:25:24.680
Master...

01:25:24.680 --> 01:25:28.920
This should be my battle as the Tyrant's Eye.

01:25:28.920 --> 01:25:31.620
I cannot leave him to face it alone.

01:25:33.230 --> 01:25:38.300
But the Dark Flame Master asked
you to entrust your fates to him.

01:25:38.300 --> 01:25:40.820
He wanted you to wait for his return.

01:25:41.850 --> 01:25:42.780
Yuuta...

01:25:45.350 --> 01:25:47.100
Is Togashi-kun back yet?

01:25:47.540 --> 01:25:49.380
Not yet, Mori Summer-chan.

01:25:49.380 --> 01:25:51.750
You! Why are you dressed as such?

01:25:51.750 --> 01:25:54.620
The Drama Club was having a rehearsal.

01:25:54.620 --> 01:25:57.340
He said he'd call if he ran into trouble...

01:25:57.340 --> 01:26:02.720
What would <i>you</i> be able to
do at the final battle, you fake?

01:26:02.720 --> 01:26:03.640
Hi-ya!

01:26:03.640 --> 01:26:06.700
I've got a knack for negotiations, you know.

01:26:06.700 --> 01:26:10.620
No one would believe you when you're dressed like that.

01:26:10.620 --> 01:26:11.810
Shut up.

01:26:11.810 --> 01:26:17.070
But why do you always come here
wearing a Drama Club costume?

01:26:17.070 --> 01:26:19.340
I don't care enough to change.

01:26:19.340 --> 01:26:21.300
It's just you guys here, anyway.

01:26:21.300 --> 01:26:22.760
Oh, really?

01:26:22.760 --> 01:26:26.480
I thought you just wanted to make Deko-chan happy.

01:26:26.480 --> 01:26:27.420
Huh?!

01:26:27.420 --> 01:26:29.540
Why would I <i>ever</i> want to make this kid—

01:26:30.620 --> 01:26:31.400
Take this!

01:26:31.400 --> 01:26:32.250
Ow!

01:26:32.250 --> 01:26:34.740
I am no longer a kid!

01:26:34.740 --> 01:26:37.510
Starting this spring, I shall be a high schooler like you!

01:26:37.510 --> 01:26:41.510
But you'll be an underclassman,
so get off me and act like one!

01:26:41.510 --> 01:26:42.960
How dare you?

01:26:42.960 --> 01:26:44.580
Mjollnir Hammer!

01:26:44.360 --> 01:26:46.880
I hope it goes well for Togashi-kun.

01:26:44.580 --> 01:26:45.720
Ow!

01:26:45.720 --> 01:26:47.100
You little...

01:26:46.880 --> 01:26:48.020
Yeah.

01:26:47.100 --> 01:26:49.320
Cut it out already!

01:26:48.020 --> 01:26:50.350
Mjollnir Tornado!

01:26:51.990 --> 01:26:53.080
Sorry I'm late.

01:26:54.890 --> 01:26:55.650
Yuuta!

01:26:56.230 --> 01:26:57.420
Sorry.

01:26:57.420 --> 01:26:59.460
My phone ran out of batteries.

01:26:59.460 --> 01:27:00.490
How did it go?

01:27:01.070 --> 01:27:02.320
Better start preparing.

01:27:02.990 --> 01:27:05.990
You'll be living by yourself starting tomorrow.

01:27:07.990 --> 01:27:09.280
Yuuta!

01:27:09.280 --> 01:27:10.210
Yuuta!

01:27:09.280 --> 01:27:10.210
Hey, now...

01:27:10.610 --> 01:27:12.540
Thank you, Yuuta!

01:27:12.540 --> 01:27:14.240
Yuuta! Yuuta! Yuuta!

01:27:13.040 --> 01:27:14.790
Come on...

01:27:14.790 --> 01:27:18.400
The Dark Flame Master is the strongest!

01:27:18.400 --> 01:27:19.100
Yeah, yeah.

01:27:19.100 --> 01:27:21.240
Yuuta, you're the strongest!

01:27:23.950 --> 01:27:29.310
Rikka's mom had to leave town for two years for her job.

01:27:29.730 --> 01:27:34.800
I went to ask her grandpa, who
was dead set on taking her back in,

01:27:34.800 --> 01:27:36.310
to let her live by herself.

01:27:37.270 --> 01:27:42.800
Rikka's grandpa would have refused
right to the end if Rikka's mom

01:27:43.320 --> 01:27:48.260
and Touka-san, who suddenly
appeared, hadn't helped me.

01:27:48.260 --> 01:27:50.240
In the end, he reluctantly agreed.

01:27:53.250 --> 01:27:56.880
It never ceases to amaze me how much stuff you have.

01:27:56.880 --> 01:27:58.630
They are all necessary.

01:27:59.050 --> 01:28:06.700
If your grandpa saw all this, maybe I wouldn't
have had to go convince him to let you live alone.

01:28:07.750 --> 01:28:08.800
Yuuta.

01:28:09.600 --> 01:28:11.350
What about my mom?

01:28:12.090 --> 01:28:14.140
She said she'd come by to see you soon.

01:28:14.850 --> 01:28:18.610
And once she finishes what she has
to do, she wants to live with you again.

01:28:18.950 --> 01:28:20.220
Really?

01:28:20.220 --> 01:28:20.980
Yeah.

01:28:28.070 --> 01:28:29.760
It's snowing.

01:28:29.760 --> 01:28:31.820
It's nearly April, too.

01:28:42.370 --> 01:28:43.650
Snowflake?

01:28:43.650 --> 01:28:44.500
Yes.

01:28:44.970 --> 01:28:48.080
"Rikka" is another word for "snowflake."

01:28:48.650 --> 01:28:53.480
It snowed so much the winter I was pregnant with her.

01:28:53.890 --> 01:28:55.700
Did you know?

01:28:55.700 --> 01:29:00.480
They say that no two snowflakes are alike.

01:29:00.910 --> 01:29:02.360
Each of them is unique.

01:29:02.360 --> 01:29:04.840
Each one is special and irreplaceable.

01:29:05.510 --> 01:29:10.280
That's why we named her Rikka.

01:29:15.450 --> 01:29:17.500
I like the snow.

01:29:19.010 --> 01:29:21.720
I used to hate it because it was so cold,

01:29:21.720 --> 01:29:24.510
but now, I love it.

01:29:32.130 --> 01:29:34.640
All right, we'll be moving these out, then.

01:29:34.640 --> 01:29:37.100
Um... But...

01:29:37.630 --> 01:29:38.800
Yuuta!

01:29:38.800 --> 01:29:40.460
Well, yes...

01:29:40.460 --> 01:29:42.150
What?! He did?!

01:29:42.150 --> 01:29:42.960
Yeah.

01:29:42.960 --> 01:29:45.200
I heard from Grandma a minute ago.

01:29:45.200 --> 01:29:51.410
Grandpa had already canceled the lease
and made an appointment with the movers.

01:29:51.410 --> 01:29:52.460
Oh, come on!

01:29:52.460 --> 01:29:57.900
Grandma called them and tried to
cancel the move, but she was too late.

01:29:57.900 --> 01:29:59.620
What do we do now?

01:29:59.620 --> 01:30:02.840
Grandpa gave her permission to live by herself,

01:30:02.840 --> 01:30:06.800
but once her stuff gets here, he might change his mind.

01:30:06.800 --> 01:30:08.230
Yeah...

01:30:08.230 --> 01:30:10.520
Oh, Grandpa's coming. I'm hanging up.

01:30:10.520 --> 01:30:12.100
What?! Wait, Touka-san?

01:30:12.100 --> 01:30:12.680
Touka-san?!

01:30:13.130 --> 01:30:14.850
Yuuta!

01:30:16.590 --> 01:30:17.600
There's no other choice!

01:30:18.950 --> 01:30:20.600
Did it <i>have</i> to end up this way?

