01:30:20.110 --> 01:30:21.110
<b>Togashi</b>

01:30:21.100 --> 01:30:22.520
This sense of déjà vu...

01:30:22.520 --> 01:30:25.980
Could the Administration Bureau
have modified my memories?

01:30:26.330 --> 01:30:28.460
It's not déjà vu, it's reality.

01:30:29.620 --> 01:30:32.200
Then we'll need to traverse the timeline in reverse—

01:30:32.200 --> 01:30:33.070
No!

01:30:33.430 --> 01:30:35.520
You can't move back into your room!

01:30:36.170 --> 01:30:38.540
Jeez... What do we do now?

01:30:39.060 --> 01:30:41.370
School starts in a week...

01:30:41.730 --> 01:30:42.880
Heilige Wasser!

01:30:43.710 --> 01:30:45.820
This isn't the time for that!

01:30:45.820 --> 01:30:48.300
Yuuta! That hurts!

01:30:48.890 --> 01:30:51.960
You don't have a place to stay.

01:30:51.960 --> 01:30:53.780
No need to worry about that.

01:30:53.780 --> 01:30:59.360
I can simply move my base of
operations here until I find a new one.

01:30:59.360 --> 01:31:02.040
Why do you assume that you can?

01:31:02.040 --> 01:31:04.560
It's not even an option for us.

01:31:05.360 --> 01:31:06.520
Why not?

01:31:13.050 --> 01:31:13.660
Look.

01:31:14.540 --> 01:31:15.900
What's this?

01:31:15.900 --> 01:31:20.380
Mom, Kuzuha, and Yumeha
moved in with my dad in Jakarta.

01:31:21.450 --> 01:31:22.880
They did?

01:31:24.150 --> 01:31:25.000
What?!

01:31:26.530 --> 01:31:28.300
They've gone overseas?!

01:31:28.300 --> 01:31:28.980
Yeah.

01:31:28.980 --> 01:31:30.260
Really?!

01:31:30.260 --> 01:31:31.100
Yeah.

01:31:32.110 --> 01:31:33.500
So they have...

01:31:33.500 --> 01:31:34.880
Overseas...

01:31:34.880 --> 01:31:35.430
What?!

01:31:35.430 --> 01:31:40.810
It means we'd be living alone
together if you moved in here.

01:31:44.450 --> 01:31:45.810
U-Um...

01:31:45.810 --> 01:31:48.200
I meant that as a joke, so...

01:31:48.200 --> 01:31:49.780
Then what do we do?

01:31:49.780 --> 01:31:51.360
Um... Er...

01:31:51.360 --> 01:31:53.320
It nearly fell again...

01:31:55.410 --> 01:32:00.460
And so, Rikka and I started living together.

01:32:13.120 --> 01:32:16.580
<b>owaranai</b>

01:32:13.120 --> 01:32:18.040
<b>In this neverending story</b>

01:32:15.430 --> 01:32:18.040
<b>monogatari</b>

01:32:17.040 --> 01:32:18.430
<b>himeta chikara</b>

01:32:17.040 --> 01:32:18.430
<b>Hidden powers,</b>

01:32:18.430 --> 01:32:22.750
<b>daichi wo tomose</b>

01:32:18.430 --> 01:32:22.750
<b>light up the Earth</b>

01:32:34.240 --> 01:32:36.600
<b>dare ni mo wakaranai</b>

01:32:34.240 --> 01:32:36.600
UGIGS

01:32:34.240 --> 01:32:36.600
UGIGS

01:32:34.240 --> 01:32:36.600
<b>No one will ever know</b>

01:32:36.600 --> 01:32:39.870
<b>ano hi no samusa nante</b>

01:32:36.600 --> 01:32:39.870
UGIGS

01:32:36.600 --> 01:32:39.870
UGIGIIS

01:32:36.600 --> 01:32:39.870
<b>How cold it was all those nights</b>

01:32:39.870 --> 01:32:42.060
<b>dare mo ga kakushiteru</b>

01:32:39.870 --> 01:32:42.060
UGIGS

01:32:39.870 --> 01:32:42.060
UGIGIIS

01:32:39.870 --> 01:32:42.060
<b>Or even the reasons everyone hides</b>

01:32:42.060 --> 01:32:45.460
<b>kemuru shikai no riyuu sura mo</b>

01:32:42.060 --> 01:32:45.460
UGIGIIS

01:32:42.060 --> 01:32:45.460
UGIGIGIGS

01:32:42.060 --> 01:32:45.460
<b>Of how they let the smoke cloud their eyes</b>

01:32:45.460 --> 01:32:47.610
<b>boku ga ikura hoetemo</b>

01:32:45.460 --> 01:32:47.610
UGIGS

01:32:45.460 --> 01:32:47.610
UGIGIS

01:32:45.460 --> 01:32:47.610
<b>No matter how hard I howl</b>

01:32:47.610 --> 01:32:51.000
<b>sekai wa sakana no me wo shiteru</b>

01:32:47.610 --> 01:32:51.000
UGIGIIS

01:32:47.610 --> 01:32:51.000
UGIGIGIGIS

01:32:47.610 --> 01:32:51.000
<b>The eyes of the world remain like those of dead fish</b>

01:32:51.000 --> 01:32:53.200
<b>dakara tte hikeru ka yo</b>

01:32:51.000 --> 01:32:53.200
UGIGS

01:32:51.000 --> 01:32:53.200
UGIGIIS

01:32:51.000 --> 01:32:53.200
<b>But that for sure won't stop me</b>

01:32:53.200 --> 01:32:56.340
<b>toge no shibuki wo kureteyaru</b>

01:32:53.200 --> 01:32:56.340
UGIGIIS

01:32:53.200 --> 01:32:56.340
UGIGIGIIS

01:32:53.200 --> 01:32:56.340
<b>I'll keep the daggers coming from my mouth</b>

01:32:56.340 --> 01:33:00.080
<b>hikari wa dare yori mo hayai to</b>

01:32:56.340 --> 01:33:00.080
<b>They all say light is faster than anything</b>

01:33:00.080 --> 01:33:01.920
<b>kanchigai wo shita</b>

01:33:00.080 --> 01:33:01.920
<b>But then they're all wrong</b>

01:33:01.920 --> 01:33:04.830
<b>yami wa kanarazu sono saki ni</b>

01:33:01.920 --> 01:33:04.830
<b>The darkness will always be there</b>

01:33:04.830 --> 01:33:07.690
<b>machikamaeteiru tte no ni</b>

01:33:04.830 --> 01:33:07.690
<b>Waiting for it far ahead</b>

01:33:07.690 --> 01:33:11.190
<b>konton wo idaita tabibito yo</b>

01:33:07.690 --> 01:33:11.190
<b>O traveler who shoulders confusion</b>

01:33:11.190 --> 01:33:14.420
<b>owaranai kaze to umi</b>

01:33:11.190 --> 01:33:14.420
UGIGS

01:33:11.190 --> 01:33:14.420
UGIGIS

01:33:11.190 --> 01:33:14.420
<b>The neverending sky and sea</b>

01:33:14.420 --> 01:33:17.260
<b>bokura no hi ga kibou ni naru</b>

01:33:14.420 --> 01:33:17.260
UGIGIS

01:33:14.420 --> 01:33:17.260
UGIGIIS

01:33:14.420 --> 01:33:17.260
<b>Our own flame will be our hope</b>

01:33:17.260 --> 01:33:20.040
<b>ishi wo motsu koto ga</b>

01:33:17.260 --> 01:33:20.040
UGIGS

01:33:17.260 --> 01:33:20.040
UGIGIIS

01:33:17.260 --> 01:33:20.040
<b>Even if having one's own thoughts</b>

01:33:20.040 --> 01:33:22.460
<b>kodoku he no jokyoku demo</b>

01:33:20.040 --> 01:33:22.460
UGIGIS

01:33:20.040 --> 01:33:22.460
UGIGIIS

01:33:20.040 --> 01:33:22.460
<b>Is but a prelude to eternal solitude</b>

01:33:22.460 --> 01:33:26.640
<b>haiiro no oka ni tachi</b>

01:33:22.460 --> 01:33:26.640
UGIGS

01:33:22.460 --> 01:33:26.640
UGIGIIS

01:33:22.460 --> 01:33:26.640
<b>We shall stand on these gray hills</b>

01:33:26.640 --> 01:33:29.060
<b>tatakaitsudzukeru sa</b>

01:33:26.640 --> 01:33:29.060
UGIGS

01:33:26.640 --> 01:33:29.060
UGIGIS

01:33:26.640 --> 01:33:29.060
<b>And continue fighting forever</b>

01:33:29.060 --> 01:33:33.910
<b>shijin ga jounetsu wo furuwaseta</b>

01:33:29.060 --> 01:33:33.910
UGIGIIS

01:33:29.060 --> 01:33:33.910
UGIGIGIGS

01:33:29.060 --> 01:33:33.910
<b>The shaper gives us passion and shakes it again</b>

01:33:33.910 --> 01:33:39.680
<b>sou bokura mo genjitsu wo warau</b>

01:33:33.910 --> 01:33:39.680
UGIGIIS

01:33:33.910 --> 01:33:39.680
UGIGIIS

01:33:33.910 --> 01:33:39.680
<b>Yes, we too shall scoff at reality</b>

01:33:48.040 --> 01:33:50.610
<b>INSIDE IDENTITY</b>

01:33:50.610 --> 01:33:53.350
<b>ibasho wa doko</b>

01:33:50.610 --> 01:33:53.350
<b>Where do I belong?</b>

01:34:03.400 --> 01:34:06.140
<b>kanchigai ga haji da toka</b>

01:34:03.400 --> 01:34:06.140
<b>"Making mistakes is a sin," they say</b>

01:34:06.140 --> 01:34:08.700
<b>sunaosa ga itai toka</b>

01:34:06.140 --> 01:34:08.700
<b>"Being honest hurts," or so they say</b>

01:34:08.700 --> 01:34:10.980
<b>dare ga nan to iou to</b>

01:34:08.700 --> 01:34:10.980
<b>But no matter who says what</b>

01:34:10.980 --> 01:34:13.880
<b>tadashisa nante wakannai ze</b>

01:34:10.980 --> 01:34:13.880
<b>You can't know if it's really true, you know</b>

01:34:13.880 --> 01:34:16.680
<b>futsuu ni nagareteiku nichijou ni</b>

01:34:13.880 --> 01:34:16.680
<b>Everyone's always trying so hard to</b>

01:34:16.680 --> 01:34:19.040
<b>muri shite najimaseta</b>

01:34:16.680 --> 01:34:19.040
<b>Fit in and act "normal"</b>

01:34:19.040 --> 01:34:21.820
<b>shizunjimatta koseitachi wo</b>

01:34:19.040 --> 01:34:21.820
<b>Killing off everything that ever made them unique,</b>

01:34:21.820 --> 01:34:24.060
<b>kande nonde haite warau</b>

01:34:21.820 --> 01:34:24.060
<b>Chewing them up, spitting them out, and laughing</b>

01:34:24.060 --> 01:34:28.680
<b>konna boku wo wakatte hoshii</b>

01:34:24.060 --> 01:34:28.680
<b>"I want you to try to understand me,"</b>

01:34:28.680 --> 01:34:34.000
<b>iitai kedo ienakutte</b>

01:34:28.680 --> 01:34:34.000
<b>I want to say it, but I just can't</b>

01:34:34.000 --> 01:34:39.010
<b>nande dare mo wakatte kunnai no to</b>

01:34:34.000 --> 01:34:39.010
<b>"Why can't anyone even try to understand me?</b>"

01:34:39.010 --> 01:34:44.100
<b>omou no wa zeitaku nano kana nano kanaa</b>

01:34:39.010 --> 01:34:44.100
<b>Is it too much for me to ask?</b> Is it, now? Is it, now?

01:34:44.100 --> 01:34:49.360
<b>kanjouteki na taiyou wa</b>

01:34:44.100 --> 01:34:49.360
<b>The sun's getting full of emotion,</b>

01:34:49.360 --> 01:34:54.460
<b>netsu wo agesugite dou ni ka narisou</b>

01:34:49.360 --> 01:34:54.460
<b>Turning the heat up so high, I think I might just blow</b>

01:34:54.460 --> 01:34:59.660
<b>sakebitakute shou ga nai</b>

01:34:54.460 --> 01:34:59.660
<b>I can't do anything, I need to scream</b>

01:34:59.660 --> 01:35:02.880
<b>gamushara ni motometeru</b>

01:34:59.660 --> 01:35:02.880
<b>Trying everything I can to find my</b>

01:35:02.880 --> 01:35:08.440
<b>IDENTITY</b>

01:35:02.880 --> 01:35:08.440
<b>IDENTITY</b>

01:35:05.620 --> 01:35:08.130
<b>INSIDE MY FEELING</b>

01:35:08.130 --> 01:35:10.660
<b>INSIDE MY JUSTICE</b>

01:35:10.660 --> 01:35:13.280
<b>jama shinai de</b>

01:35:10.660 --> 01:35:13.280
<b>Don't try to stop me</b>

01:35:13.280 --> 01:35:15.240
<b>ibasho wa doko</b>

01:35:13.280 --> 01:35:15.240
<b>Where do I belong?</b>

01:35:59.790 --> 01:36:02.030
I wonder how he's doing.

01:36:02.510 --> 01:36:05.060
My dear Hero.
